				- "implementation-defined"
			}
			- " value, but with the following suggestions to consider:"
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		ul {
			li {
				p {
					- "Set a minimum value that most often results in the resources being loaded before they\n   intersect the viewport under normal usage patterns for the given device."
				}
			}
			li {
				p {
					- "The typical scrolling speed: increase the value for devices with faster typical scrolling\n   speeds."
				}
			}
			li {
				p {
					- "The current scrolling speed or momentum: the UA can attempt to predict where the scrolling\n   will likely stop, and adjust the value accordingly."
				}
			}
			li {
				p {
					- "The network quality: increase the value for slow or high-latency connections."
				}
			}
			li {
				p {
					- "User preferences can influence the value."
				}
			}
