				- "realm"
			}
			- "\n  boundaries, this specification defines the following infrastructure for\n  serializing and deserializing objects, including in some cases transferring the underlying data\n  instead of copying it. Collectively this serialization/deserialization process is known as\n  \"structured cloning\", although most APIs perform separate serialization and deserialization steps.\n  (With the notable exception being the "
			code id="safe-passing-of-structured-data:dom-structuredclone" {
				a href="#dom-structuredclone" {
					- "structuredClone()"
				}
			}
			- "\n  method.)"
		}
