				- "URL"
			}
			- " for a \"non-HTTP\" API, decoded\n  using "
			a id="resource-metadata-management:utf-8-decode-without-bom" href="https://encoding.spec.whatwg.org/#utf-8-decode-without-bom" data-x-internal="utf-8-decode-without-bom" {
				- "UTF-8 decode without BOM"
			}
			- ". "
			a href="#refsCOOKIES" {
