			a href="https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#idl-constructors" id="html-element-constructors:constructor-operation" data-x-internal="constructor-operation" {
				- "constructor\n  operations"
			}
			- ". It must appear only once on a constructor operation, and the interface must\n  contain only the single, annotated constructor operation, and no others. The annotated\n  constructor operation must be declared to take no arguments."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "Interfaces declared with constructor operations that are annotated with the "
			code id="html-element-constructors:htmlconstructor-2" {
