			li {
				a href="#text-content" id="phrasing-content:text-content" {
					- "text"
				}
			}
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p class="note" {
			- "Most elements that are categorized as phrasing content can only contain elements\n  that are themselves categorized as phrasing content, not any flow content."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			dfn id="text-content" {
				- "Text"
			}
			- ", in the context of content models, means either nothing,\n  or "
			code id="phrasing-content:text" {
				a data-x-internal="text" href="https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#interface-text" {
					- "Text"
				}
			}
			- " nodes. "
			a href="#text-content" id="phrasing-content:text-content-2" {
				- "Text"
			}
			- " is sometimes used as a content\n  model on its own, but is also "
			a href="#phrasing-content-2" id="phrasing-content:phrasing-content-2-2" {
				- "phrasing content"
			}
			- ", and can be "
			a href="#inter-element-whitespace" id="phrasing-content:inter-element-whitespace" {
				- "inter-element\n  whitespace"
			}
			- " (if the "
			code id="phrasing-content:text-2" {
				a data-x-internal="text" href="https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#interface-text" {
					- "Text"
				}
			}
			- " nodes are empty or contain just "
			a id="phrasing-content:space-characters" href="https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#ascii-whitespace" data-x-internal="space-characters" {
				- "ASCII\n  whitespace"
			}
			- ")."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			code id="phrasing-content:text-3" {
				a data-x-internal="text" href="https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#interface-text" {
					- "Text"
				}
			}
			- " nodes and attribute values must consist of "
			a href="https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#scalar-value" id="phrasing-content:scalar-value" data-x-internal="scalar-value" {
				- "scalar\n  values"
			}
			- ", excluding "
			a href="https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#noncharacter" id="phrasing-content:noncharacter" data-x-internal="noncharacter" {
				- "noncharacters"
			}
			- ", and "
			a href="https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#control" id="phrasing-content:control" data-x-internal="control" {
				- "controls"
			}
			- " other than "
			a id="phrasing-content:space-characters-2" href="https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#ascii-whitespace" data-x-internal="space-characters" {
				- "ASCII whitespace"
			}
			- ".\n\n   \n  \n\n  This specification includes extra constraints on the exact value of "
			code id="phrasing-content:text-4" {
				a data-x-internal="text" href="https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#interface-text" {
					- "Text"
				}
			}
			- " nodes and\n  attribute values depending on their precise context.\n\n  \n\n  "
		}
		- "\n\n\n\n  "
		h6 id="embedded-content-2" {
			span class="secno" {
				- "3.2.5.2.6"
			}
			- " Embedded content"
			a href="#embedded-content-2" class="self-link"
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			dfn id="embedded-content-category" data-export="" {
				- "Embedded content"
			}
			- " is content that imports\n  another resource into the document, or content from another vocabulary that\n  is inserted into the document."
		}
		- "\n\n  \n  "
		ul class="brief category-list" {
			li {
				code id="embedded-content-2:the-audio-element" {
					a href="#the-audio-element" {
						- "audio"
					}
				}
			}
			li {
				code id="embedded-content-2:the-canvas-element" {
					a href="#the-canvas-element" {
						- "canvas"
					}
				}
			}
			li {
				code id="embedded-content-2:the-embed-element" {
					a href="#the-embed-element" {
						- "embed"
					}
				}
			}
			li {
				code id="embedded-content-2:the-iframe-element" {
					a href="#the-iframe-element" {
						- "iframe"
					}
				}
			}
			li {
				code id="embedded-content-2:the-img-element" {
					a href="#the-img-element" {
						- "img"
					}
				}
			}
			li {
				a id="embedded-content-2:mathml-math" href="https://w3c.github.io/mathml-core/#the-top-level-math-element" data-x-internal="mathml-math" {
					- "MathML "
					code {
						- "math"
					}
				}
			}
			li {
				code id="embedded-content-2:the-object-element" {
					a href="#the-object-element" {
						- "object"
					}
				}
			}
			li {
				code id="embedded-content-2:the-picture-element" {
					a href="#the-picture-element" {
						- "picture"
					}
				}
			}
			li {
				a id="embedded-content-2:svg-svg" href="https://svgwg.org/svg2-draft/struct.html#SVGElement" data-x-internal="svg-svg" {
					- "SVG "
					code {
						- "svg"
					}
				}
			}
			li {
				code id="embedded-content-2:the-video-element" {
					a href="#the-video-element" {
						- "video"
					}
				}
			}
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "Elements that are from namespaces other than the "
			a id="embedded-content-2:html-namespace-2" href="https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#html-namespace" data-x-internal="html-namespace-2" {
				- "HTML namespace"
			}
			- " and that convey\n  content but not metadata, are "
			a href="#embedded-content-category" id="embedded-content-2:embedded-content-category" {
				- "embedded content"
			}
			- " for the purposes of the content models\n  defined in this specification. (For example, MathML or SVG.)"
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "Some embedded content elements can have "
			dfn id="fallback-content" {
				- "fallback content"
			}
			- ": content that is to be used\n  when the external resource cannot be used (e.g. because it is of an unsupported format). The\n  element definitions state what the fallback is, if any."
		}
		- "\n  \n\n\n  "
		h6 id="interactive-content" {
			span class="secno" {
				- "3.2.5.2.7"
			}
			- " Interactive content"
			a href="#interactive-content" class="self-link"
		}
		- "\n\n\n\n  "
		p {
			dfn id="interactive-content-2" data-export="" {
				- "Interactive content"
			}
			- " is content that is specifically intended for user\n  interaction."
		}
		- "\n\n  \n  "
		ul class="brief category-list" {
			li {
				code id="interactive-content:the-a-element" {
					a href="#the-a-element" {
						- "a"
					}
				}
				- " (if the "
				code id="interactive-content:attr-hyperlink-href" {
					a href="#attr-hyperlink-href" {
						- "href"
					}
				}
				- " attribute is present)"
			}
			li {
				code id="interactive-content:the-audio-element" {
					a href="#the-audio-element" {
						- "audio"
					}
				}
				- " (if the "
				code id="interactive-content:attr-media-controls" {
					a href="#attr-media-controls" {
						- "controls"
					}
				}
				- " attribute is present)"
			}
			li {
				code id="interactive-content:the-button-element" {
					a href="#the-button-element" {
						- "button"
					}
				}
			}
			li {
				code id="interactive-content:the-details-element" {
					a href="#the-details-element" {
						- "details"
					}
				}
			}
			li {
				code id="interactive-content:the-embed-element" {
					a href="#the-embed-element" {
						- "embed"
					}
				}
			}
			li {
				code id="interactive-content:the-iframe-element" {
					a href="#the-iframe-element" {
						- "iframe"
					}
				}
			}
			li {
				code id="interactive-content:the-img-element" {
					a href="#the-img-element" {
						- "img"
					}
				}
				- " (if the "
				code id="interactive-content:attr-hyperlink-usemap" {
					a href="#attr-hyperlink-usemap" {
						- "usemap"
					}
				}
				- " attribute is present)"
			}
			li {
				code id="interactive-content:the-input-element" {
					a href="#the-input-element" {
						- "input"
					}
				}
				- " (if the "
				code id="interactive-content:attr-input-type" {
					a href="#attr-input-type" {
						- "type"
					}
				}
				- " attribute is "
				em {
					- "not"
				}
				- " in the "
				a href="#hidden-state-(type=hidden)" id="interactive-content:hidden-state-(type=hidden)" {
					- "Hidden"
				}
				- " state)"
			}
			li {
				code id="interactive-content:the-label-element" {
					a href="#the-label-element" {
						- "label"
					}
				}
			}
			li {
				code id="interactive-content:the-select-element" {
					a href="#the-select-element" {
						- "select"
					}
				}
			}
			li {
				code id="interactive-content:the-textarea-element" {
					a href="#the-textarea-element" {
						- "textarea"
					}
				}
			}
			li {
				code id="interactive-content:the-video-element" {
					a href="#the-video-element" {
						- "video"
					}
				}
				- " (if the "
				code id="interactive-content:attr-media-controls-2" {
					a href="#attr-media-controls" {
						- "controls"
					}
				}
				- " attribute is present)"
			}
		}
		- "\n\n\n\n  "
		h6 id="palpable-content" {
			span class="secno" {
				- "3.2.5.2.8"
			}
			- " Palpable content"
			a href="#palpable-content" class="self-link"
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "As a general rule, elements whose content model allows any "
			a href="#flow-content-2" id="palpable-content:flow-content-2" {
				- "flow content"
			}
			- " or\n  "
			a href="#phrasing-content-2" id="palpable-content:phrasing-content-2" {
				- "phrasing content"
			}
			- " should have at least one node in its "
			a href="#concept-html-contents" id="palpable-content:concept-html-contents" {
				- "contents"
			}
			- " that is "
			dfn id="palpable-content-2" data-export="" {
				- "palpable content"
			}
			- " and\n  that does not have the "
			code id="palpable-content:attr-hidden" {
				a href="#attr-hidden" {
					- "hidden"
				}
			}
			- " attribute specified."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p class="note" {
			a href="#palpable-content-2" id="palpable-content:palpable-content-2" {
				- "Palpable content"
			}
			- " makes an element non-empty by providing either\n  some descendant non-empty "
			a href="#text-content" id="palpable-content:text-content" {
				- "text"
			}
			- ", or else something users can\n  hear ("
			code id="palpable-content:the-audio-element" {
				a href="#the-audio-element" {
					- "audio"
				}
			}
			- " elements) or view ("
			code id="palpable-content:the-video-element" {
				a href="#the-video-element" {
					- "video"
				}
			}
			- ", "
			code id="palpable-content:the-img-element" {
				a href="#the-img-element" {
					- "img"
				}
			}
			- ", or\n  "
			code id="palpable-content:the-canvas-element" {
				a href="#the-canvas-element" {
					- "canvas"
				}
			}
			- " elements) or otherwise interact with (for example, interactive form\n  controls)."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "This requirement is not a hard requirement, however, as there are many cases where an element\n  can be empty legitimately, for example when it is used as a placeholder which will later be filled\n  in by a script, or when the element is part of a template and would on most pages be filled in but\n  on some pages is not relevant."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "Conformance checkers are encouraged to provide a mechanism for authors to find elements that\n  fail to fulfill this requirement, as an authoring aid."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "The following elements are palpable content:"
		}
		- "\n\n  \n  "
		ul class="brief category-list" {
			li {
				code id="palpable-content:the-a-element" {
					a href="#the-a-element" {
						- "a"
					}
				}
			}
			li {
				code id="palpable-content:the-abbr-element" {
					a href="#the-abbr-element" {
						- "abbr"
					}
				}
			}
			li {
				code id="palpable-content:the-address-element" {
					a href="#the-address-element" {
						- "address"
					}
				}
			}
			li {
				code id="palpable-content:the-article-element" {
					a href="#the-article-element" {
						- "article"
					}
				}
			}
			li {
				code id="palpable-content:the-aside-element" {
					a href="#the-aside-element" {
						- "aside"
					}
				}
