			- "A "
			dfn id="paragraph" {
				- "paragraph"
			}
			- " is typically a run of "
			a href="#phrasing-content-2" id="paragraphs:phrasing-content-2" {
				- "phrasing content"
			}
			- " that forms a block\n  of text with one or more sentences that discuss a particular topic, as in typography, but can also\n  be used for more general thematic grouping. For instance, an address is also a paragraph, as is a\n  part of a form, a byline, or a stanza in a poem."
		}
