		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			dfn id="early-hints-2" {
				- "Early hints"
			}
			- " allow user-agents to perform some operations, such as to speculatively\n  load resources that are likely to be used by the document, before the navigation request is fully\n  handled by the server and a response code is served. Servers can indicate early hints by serving a\n  "
			a href="https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-response" id="early-hints:concept-response" data-x-internal="concept-response" {
				- "response"
			}
			- " with a 103 status code before serving the final\n  "
			a href="https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-response" id="early-hints:concept-response-2" data-x-internal="concept-response" {
				- "response"
			}
			- "."
			a href="#refsRFC8297" {
				- "[RFC8297]"
			}
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p class="note" {
			- "For compatibility reasons "
			a href="https://httpwg.org/specs/rfc8297.html#security-considerations" {
				- "early hints are typically\n  delivered over HTTP/2 or above"
			}
			- ", but for readability we use HTTP/1.1-style notation below."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		div class="example" {
			- "\n   "
			p {
				- "For example, given the following sequence of responses:"
			}
			- "\n   "
			pre {
				- "103 Early Hint\nLink: </image.png>; "
				a href="#attr-link-rel" id="early-hints:attr-link-rel" {
					- "rel"
				}
				- "="
				a href="#link-type-preload" id="early-hints:link-type-preload" {
					- "preload"
				}
				- "; "
				a href="#attr-link-as" id="early-hints:attr-link-as" {
					- "as"
				}
				- "=image"
			}
			- "\n\n   "
			pre {
				- "200 OK\nContent-Type: text/html\n\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n...\n<img src=\"/image.png\">"
			}
			- "\n\n   "
			p {
				- "the image will start loading before the HTML content arrives."
			}
			- "\n  "
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p class="note" {
			- "Only the first early hint response served during the navigation is handled, and it\n  is discarded if it is succeeded by a cross-origin redirect."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "In addition to the `"
			code id="early-hints:http-link" {
				a data-x-internal="http-link" href="https://httpwg.org/specs/rfc8288.html#header" {
					- "Link"
				}
			}
			- "` headers, it is possible that the 103\n  response contains a "
			a id="early-hints:content-security-policy" href="https://w3c.github.io/webappsec-csp/#content-security-policy-object" data-x-internal="content-security-policy" {
				- "Content Security Policy"
			}
			- " header, which is enforced when processing\n  the early hint."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		div class="example" {
			- "\n   "
			p {
				- "For example, given the following sequence of responses:"
			}
			- "\n   "
			pre {
				- "103 Early Hint\nContent-Security-Policy: style-src: self;\nLink: </style.css>; "
				a href="#attr-link-rel" id="early-hints:attr-link-rel-2" {
					- "rel"
				}
				- "="
				a href="#link-type-preload" id="early-hints:link-type-preload-2" {
					- "preload"
				}
				- "; "
				a href="#attr-link-as" id="early-hints:attr-link-as-2" {
					- "as"
				}
				- "=style"
			}
			- "\n\n   "
			pre {
				- "103 Early Hint\nLink: </image.png>; "
				a href="#attr-link-rel" id="early-hints:attr-link-rel-3" {
					- "rel"
				}
				- "="
				a href="#link-type-preload" id="early-hints:link-type-preload-3" {
					- "preload"
				}
				- "; "
				a href="#attr-link-as" id="early-hints:attr-link-as-3" {
					- "as"
				}
				- "=image"
			}
			- "\n\n   "
			pre {
				- "302 Redirect\nLocation: /alternate.html"
			}
			- "\n\n   "
			pre {
				- "200 OK\nContent-Security-Policy: style-src: none;\nLink: </font.ttf>; "
				a href="#attr-link-rel" id="early-hints:attr-link-rel-4" {
					- "rel"
				}
				- "="
				a href="#link-type-preload" id="early-hints:link-type-preload-4" {
					- "preload"
				}
				- "; "
				a href="#attr-link-as" id="early-hints:attr-link-as-4" {
					- "as"
				}
				- "=font"
			}
			- "\n\n   "
			p {
				- "The font and style would be loaded, and the image will be discarded, as only the first early\n   hint response in the final redirect chain is respected. The late "
				a id="early-hints:content-security-policy-2" href="https://w3c.github.io/webappsec-csp/#content-security-policy-object" data-x-internal="content-security-policy" {
					- "Content Security\n   Policy"
				}
				- " header comes after the request to fetch the style has already been performed, but\n   the style will not be accessible to the document."
			}
			- "\n  "
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "To "
