		- "\n\n\n\n  \n\n  "
		h4 id="interactions-of-styling-and-scripting" {
			span class="secno" {
				- "4.2.7"
			}
			- " Interactions of styling and scripting"
			a href="#interactions-of-styling-and-scripting" class="self-link"
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "If the style sheet referenced no other resources (e.g., it was an internal style sheet given by\n  a "
			code id="interactions-of-styling-and-scripting:the-style-element" {
				a href="#the-style-element" {
					- "style"
				}
			}
			- " element with no "
			code {
				- "@import"
			}
			- " rules), then the style rules\n  must be "
			a href="#immediately" id="interactions-of-styling-and-scripting:immediately" {
				- "immediately"
			}
			- " made available to script; otherwise, the style rules must only be\n  made available to script once the "
			a href="#event-loop" id="interactions-of-styling-and-scripting:event-loop" {
				- "event loop"
			}
			- " reaches its "
			a href="#update-the-rendering" id="interactions-of-styling-and-scripting:update-the-rendering" {
				- "update the\n  rendering"
			}
			- " step."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p id="a-style-sheet-that-is-blocking-scripts" {
			- "An element "
			var {
				- "el"
			}
			- " in the context of a\n  "
			code id="interactions-of-styling-and-scripting:document" {
				a href="#document" {
					- "Document"
				}
			}
			- " of an "
			a href="#html-parser" id="interactions-of-styling-and-scripting:html-parser" {
				- "HTML parser"
			}
			- " or "
			a href="#xml-parser" id="interactions-of-styling-and-scripting:xml-parser" {
				- "XML parser"
			}
			- " "
			dfn id="contributes-a-script-blocking-style-sheet" {
				- "contributes a\n  script-blocking style sheet"
			}
			- " if all of the following are true:"
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		ul {
			li {
				p {
					var {
						- "el"
					}
					- " was created by that "
					code id="interactions-of-styling-and-scripting:document-2" {
						a href="#document" {
							- "Document"
						}
					}
					- "'s parser."
				}
			}
			li {
				p {
					var {
						- "el"
					}
					- " is either a "
					code id="interactions-of-styling-and-scripting:the-style-element-2" {
						a href="#the-style-element" {
							- "style"
						}
					}
					- " element or a "
					code id="interactions-of-styling-and-scripting:the-link-element" {
						a href="#the-link-element" {
							- "link"
						}
					}
					- " element that\n   was an "
					a href="#link-type-stylesheet" id="interactions-of-styling-and-scripting:link-type-stylesheet" {
						- "external resource link that contributes to the styling\n   processing model"
					}
					- " when the "
					var {
						- "el"
					}
					- " was created by the parser."
				}
			}
			li {
				p {
					var {
						- "el"
					}
					- "'s "
					code {
						- "media"
					}
					- " attribute's value\n   "
					a href="#matches-the-environment" id="interactions-of-styling-and-scripting:matches-the-environment" {
						- "matches the environment"
					}
					- "."
				}
			}
			li {
				p {
					var {
						- "el"
					}
					- "'s style sheet was enabled when the element was created by the\n   parser."
				}
			}
			li {
				p {
					- "The last time the "
					a href="#event-loop" id="interactions-of-styling-and-scripting:event-loop-2" {
						- "event loop"
					}
					- " reached "
					a href="#step1" {
						- "step 1"
					}
					- ",\n   "
					var {
						- "el"
					}
					- "'s "
					a id="interactions-of-styling-and-scripting:root" href="https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-tree-root" data-x-internal="root" {
						- "root"
					}
					- " was that "
					code id="interactions-of-styling-and-scripting:document-3" {
						a href="#document" {
							- "Document"
						}
					}
					- "."
				}
			}
			li {
				- "\n    "
				p {
					- "The user agent hasn't given up on loading that particular style sheet yet. A user agent\n    may give up on loading a style sheet at any time."
				}
				- "\n\n    "
				p class="note" {
					- "Giving up on a style sheet before the style sheet loads, if the style sheet\n    eventually does still load, means that the script might end up operating with incorrect\n    information. For example, if a style sheet sets the color of an element to green, but a script\n    that inspects the resulting style is executed before the sheet is loaded, the script will find\n    that the element is black (or whatever the default color is), and might thus make poor choices\n    (e.g., deciding to use black as the color elsewhere on the page, instead of green). Implementers\n    have to balance the likelihood of a script using incorrect information with the performance impact\n    of doing nothing while waiting for a slow network request to finish."
				}
				- "\n   "
			}
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p class="XXX" {
			- "It is expected that counterparts to the above rules also apply to\n  "
			code id="interactions-of-styling-and-scripting:xml-stylesheet" {
				a data-x-internal="xml-stylesheet" href="https://www.w3.org/TR/xml-stylesheet/#the-xml-stylesheet-processing-instruction" {
					- "<?xml-stylesheet?>"
				}
			}
			- " PIs. However, this has not yet been thoroughly\n  investigated."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "A "
			code id="interactions-of-styling-and-scripting:document-4" {
				a href="#document" {
					- "Document"
				}
			}
			- " has a "
			dfn id="script-blocking-style-sheet-set" {
				- "script-blocking style sheet set"
			}
			- ", which is an "
			a href="https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#ordered-set" id="interactions-of-styling-and-scripting:set" data-x-internal="set" {
				- "ordered set"
			}
			- ", initially empty."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "A "
			code id="interactions-of-styling-and-scripting:document-5" {
				a href="#document" {
					- "Document"
				}
			}
			- " "
			var {
				- "document"
			}
			- " "
			dfn id="has-a-style-sheet-that-is-blocking-scripts" {
				- "has a style sheet that is blocking\n  scripts"
			}
			- " if the following steps return true:"
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		ol {
			li {
				p {
					- "If "
					var {
						- "document"
					}
					- "'s "
					a href="#script-blocking-style-sheet-set" id="interactions-of-styling-and-scripting:script-blocking-style-sheet-set" {
						- "script-blocking style sheet set"
					}
					- " is not "
					a href="https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#list-is-empty" id="interactions-of-styling-and-scripting:list-is-empty" data-x-internal="list-is-empty" {
						- "empty"
					}
					- ", then return true."
				}
			}
			li {
				p {
					- "If "
					var {
						- "document"
					}
					- "'s "
					a href="#node-navigable" id="interactions-of-styling-and-scripting:node-navigable" {
						- "node navigable"
					}
					- " is null, then return false."
				}
			}
			li {
				p {
					- "Let "
					var {
						- "containerDocument"
					}
					- " be "
					var {
						- "document"
					}
					- "'s "
					a href="#node-navigable" id="interactions-of-styling-and-scripting:node-navigable-2" {
						- "node navigable"
					}
					- "'s\n   "
					a href="#nav-container" id="interactions-of-styling-and-scripting:nav-container" {
						- "container document"
					}
					- "."
				}
			}
			li {
				p {
					- "If "
					var {
						- "containerDocument"
					}
					- " is non-null and "
					var {
						- "containerDocument"
					}
					- "'s\n   "
					a href="#script-blocking-style-sheet-set" id="interactions-of-styling-and-scripting:script-blocking-style-sheet-set-2" {
						- "script-blocking style sheet set"
					}
					- " is not "
					a href="https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#list-is-empty" id="interactions-of-styling-and-scripting:list-is-empty-2" data-x-internal="list-is-empty" {
						- "empty"
					}
					- ",\n   then return true."
				}
			}
			li {
				p {
					- "Return false."
				}
			}
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "A "
			code id="interactions-of-styling-and-scripting:document-6" {
				a href="#document" {
					- "Document"
				}
			}
			- " "
			dfn id="has-no-style-sheet-that-is-blocking-scripts" {
				- "has no style sheet that is blocking scripts"
			}
			- " if it does not\n  "
			a href="#has-a-style-sheet-that-is-blocking-scripts" id="interactions-of-styling-and-scripting:has-a-style-sheet-that-is-blocking-scripts" {
				- "have a style sheet that is blocking\n  scripts"
			}
			- "."
		}
		- "\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n  "
		h3 id="sections" {
			span class="secno" {
