					c- f="" {
						- "q"
					}
					c- p="" {
						- ">"
					}
					- "I love my job. People ask me what I do for fun when I'm not at\nwork. But I'm paid to do my hobby, so I never know what to\nanswer. Some people wonder what they would do if they didn't have to\nwork... but I know what I would do, because I was unemployed for a\nyear, and I filled that time doing exactly what I do now."
					c- p="" {
