			- "\n\n   \n\n   "
			pre lang="en-GB" {
				code class="html" {
					c- p="" {
						- "<"
					}
					c- f="" {
						- "p"
					}
					c- p="" {
						- ">"
					}
					- "Dudley was ninety-two, in his second life, and fast approaching\ntime for another rejuvenation. Despite his body having the physical\nage of a standard fifty-year-old, the prospect of a long degrading\ncampaign within academia was one he regarded with dread. For a\nsupposedly advanced civilization, the Intersolar Commonwealth could be\nappallingly backward at times, not to mention cruel."
					c- p="" {
						- "</"
					}
					c- f="" {
						- "p"
					}
					c- p="" {
						- ">"
					}
					- "\n"
					c- p="" {
