			code id="the-i-element:the-i-element-6" {
				a href="#the-i-element" {
					- "i"
				}
			}
			- " elements, just like any other\n  element can be restyled. Thus, it is not the case that content in "
			code id="the-i-element:the-i-element-7" {
				a href="#the-i-element" {
					- "i"
				}
			}
			- " elements will\n  necessarily be italicized."
