		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "When a user agent is to handle a resource obtained from a fetch "
			dfn id="as-a-download" {
				- "as a download"
			}
			- ", it\n  should provide the user with a way to save the resource for later use, if a resource is\n  successfully obtained. Otherwise, it should report any problems downloading the file to the\n  user."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "If the user agent needs a filename for a resource being handled "
			a href="#as-a-download" id="downloading-resources:as-a-download-2" {
				- "as a download"
			}
			- ", it\n  should select one using the following algorithm."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p class="warning" {
			- "This algorithm is intended to mitigate security dangers involved in downloading\n  files from untrusted sites, and user agents are strongly urged to follow it."
		}
		- " \n\n  "
		ol {
			li {
				p {
					- "Let "
					var {
						- "filename"
					}
					- " be the undefined value."
				}
			}
			li {
				p {
					- "If the resource has a `"
					code id="downloading-resources:http-content-disposition-3" {
