			}
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "The elements that form part of the table model have complicated content model requirements that\n  do not allow for the "
			code id="edits-and-tables:the-ins-element" {
				a href="#the-ins-element" {
					- "ins"
				}
			}
			- " and "
			code id="edits-and-tables:the-del-element" {
				a href="#the-del-element" {
					- "del"
				}
			}
			- " elements, so indicating edits to a\n  table can be difficult."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "To indicate that an entire row or an entire column has been added or removed, the entire\n  contents of each cell in that row or column can be wrapped in "
			code id="edits-and-tables:the-ins-element-2" {
				a href="#the-ins-element" {
