							- "viewport"
						}
						- " width). Notice that\n     the slightly wider "
						a id="introduction-3:viewport-12" href="https://drafts.csswg.org/css2/#viewport" data-x-internal="viewport" {
							- "viewport"
						}
						- " results in a smaller image because of the different\n     layout."
