		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "The problem with this is that the user agent does not necessarily know what dimensions to use\n  for the image when the image is loading. To avoid the layout having to be reflowed multiple times\n  as the page is loading, CSS and CSS media queries can be used to provide the dimensions:"
		}
