		- "\n\n\n\n  "
		h6 id="a-group-of-images-that-form-a-single-larger-picture-with-links" {
			span class="secno" {
				- "4.8.4.4.10"
			}
			- " A group of images that form a single larger picture with links"
			a href="#a-group-of-images-that-form-a-single-larger-picture-with-links" class="self-link"
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "Generally, "
			a href="#image-map" id="a-group-of-images-that-form-a-single-larger-picture-with-links:image-map" {
				- "image maps"
			}
			- " should be used instead of slicing an image\n  for links."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "However, if an image is indeed sliced and any of the components of the sliced picture are the\n  sole contents of links, then one image per link must have alternative text in its "
			code id="a-group-of-images-that-form-a-single-larger-picture-with-links:attr-img-alt" {
				a href="#attr-img-alt" {
					- "alt"
				}
			}
			- " attribute representing the purpose of the link."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		div class="example" {
			- "\n\n   "
			p {
				- "In the following example, a picture representing the flying spaghetti monster emblem, with\n   each of the left noodly appendages and the right noodly appendages in different images, so that\n   the user can pick the left side or the right side in an adventure."
			}
			- "\n\n   "
			pre {
				code class="html" {
					c- p="" {
						- "<"
					}
					c- f="" {
						- "h1"
					}
					c- p="" {
						- ">"
					}
					- "The Church"
					c- p="" {
						- "</"
					}
					c- f="" {
						- "h1"
					}
					c- p="" {
						- ">"
					}
					- "\n"
					c- p="" {
						- "<"
					}
					c- f="" {
						- "p"
					}
					c- p="" {
						- ">"
					}
					- "You come across a flying spaghetti monster. Which side of His\nNoodliness do you wish to reach out for?"
					c- p="" {
						- "</"
					}
					c- f="" {
						- "p"
					}
					c- p="" {
						- ">"
					}
					- "\n"
					strong {
						c- p="" {
							- "<"
						}
						c- f="" {
							- "p"
						}
						c- p="" {
							- "><"
						}
						c- f="" {
							- "a"
						}
						- " "
						c- e="" {
							- "href"
						}
						c- o="" {
							- "="
						}
						c- s="" {
							- "\"?go=left\""
						}
						- " "
						c- p="" {
							- "><"
						}
						c- f="" {
							- "img"
						}
						- " "
						c- e="" {
							- "src"
						}
						c- o="" {
							- "="
						}
						c- s="" {
							- "\"fsm-left.png\""
						}
						- "  "
						c- e="" {
							- "alt"
						}
						c- o="" {
							- "="
						}
						c- s="" {
							- "\"Left side. \""
						}
						c- p="" {
							- "></"
						}
						c- f="" {
							- "a"
						}
						- "\n  "
						c- p="" {
							- "><"
						}
						c- f="" {
							- "img"
						}
						- " "
						c- e="" {
							- "src"
						}
						c- o="" {
							- "="
						}
						c- s="" {
							- "\"fsm-middle.png\""
						}
						- " "
						c- e="" {
							- "alt"
						}
						c- o="" {
							- "="
						}
						c- s="" {
							- "\"\""
						}
						- "\n  "
						c- p="" {
							- "><"
						}
						c- f="" {
							- "a"
						}
						- " "
						c- e="" {
							- "href"
						}
						c- o="" {
							- "="
						}
						c- s="" {
							- "\"?go=right\""
						}
						c- p="" {
							- "><"
						}
						c- f="" {
							- "img"
						}
						- " "
						c- e="" {
							- "src"
						}
						c- o="" {
							- "="
						}
						c- s="" {
							- "\"fsm-right.png\""
						}
						- " "
						c- e="" {
							- "alt"
						}
						c- o="" {
							- "="
						}
						c- s="" {
							- "\"Right side.\""
						}
						c- p="" {
							- "></"
						}
						c- f="" {
							- "a"
						}
						c- p="" {
							- "></"
						}
						c- f="" {
							- "p"
						}
						c- p="" {
							- ">"
						}
					}
				}
			}
			- "\n\n  "
