					- "\n\n     "
					p {
						- "In such cases it is unnecessary (and indeed discouraged) to include a reference to the\n     presence of the image itself in the alternative text, since such text would be redundant with\n     the browser itself reporting the presence of the image. For example, if the alternative text\n     was \"A photo of Isaac Asimov\", then a conforming user agent might read that out as \"(Image) A\n     photo of Isaac Asimov\" rather than the more useful \"(Image) Isaac Asimov had dark hair, a tall\n     forehead, and wore glasses...\"."
					}
					- "\n\n    "
				}
				- "\n   "
			}
			dt id="unknown-images" {
				- "Images whose contents are not known"
			}
			dd {
				- "\n    "
				p {
					- "In some unfortunate cases, there might be no alternative text available at all, either\n    because the image is obtained in some automated fashion without any associated alternative text\n    (e.g., a webcam), or because the page is being generated by a script using user-provided images\n    where the user did not provide suitable or usable alternative text (e.g. photograph sharing\n    sites), or because the author does not themself know what the images represent (e.g. a blind\n    photographer sharing an image on their blog)."
				}
				- "\n\n    "
				p {
					- "In such cases, the "
					code id="a-key-part-of-the-content:attr-img-alt-3" {
						a href="#attr-img-alt" {
							- "alt"
						}
					}
					- " attribute may be omitted, but one of\n    the following conditions must be met as well:"
				}
				- "\n\n    "
				ul {
					li id="figcaption-as-alt-condition" {
						p {
							- "The "
							code id="a-key-part-of-the-content:the-img-element" {
								a href="#the-img-element" {
									- "img"
								}
							}
							- " element is in a\n     "
							code id="a-key-part-of-the-content:the-figure-element" {
								a href="#the-figure-element" {
									- "figure"
								}
							}
							- " element that contains a "
							code id="a-key-part-of-the-content:the-figcaption-element" {
								a href="#the-figcaption-element" {
									- "figcaption"
								}
							}
							- " element that contains\n     content other than "
							a href="#inter-element-whitespace" id="a-key-part-of-the-content:inter-element-whitespace" {
								- "inter-element whitespace"
							}
							- ", and, ignoring the\n     "
							code id="a-key-part-of-the-content:the-figcaption-element-2" {
								a href="#the-figcaption-element" {
									- "figcaption"
								}
							}
							- " element and its descendants, the "
							code id="a-key-part-of-the-content:the-figure-element-2" {
