		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "When the attribute is set, the content is treated as being from a unique "
			a href="#concept-origin-opaque" id="the-iframe-element:concept-origin-opaque" {
				- "opaque origin"
			}
			- ", forms, scripts, and various potentially\n  annoying APIs are disabled, and links are prevented from targeting other "
