				code {
					- "type"
				}
			}
			- " attribute,\n  if present, gives the "
			a id="the-embed-element:mime-type" href="https://mimesniff.spec.whatwg.org/#mime-type" data-x-internal="mime-type" {
				- "MIME type"
			}
			- " by which the plugin to instantiate is selected. The\n  value must be a "
			a id="the-embed-element:valid-mime-type-string" href="https://mimesniff.spec.whatwg.org/#valid-mime-type" data-x-internal="valid-mime-type-string" {
				- "valid MIME type string"
			}
			- ". If both the "
			code id="the-embed-element:attr-embed-type-2" {
				a href="#attr-embed-type" {
					- "type"
				}
			}
			- " attribute and the "
