			- ", in some cases with a "
			code {
				- "codecs"
			}
			- " parameter. (Whether the\n  "
			code {
				- "codecs"
			}
			- " parameter is allowed or not depends on the MIME type.)\n  "
			a href="#refsRFC6381" {
				- "[RFC6381]"
			}
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "Types are usually somewhat incomplete descriptions; for example \""
			code {
				- "video/mpeg"
			}
			- "\" doesn't say anything except what the container type is, and even a\n  type like \""
			code {
				- "video/mp4; codecs=\"avc1.42E01E, mp4a.40.2\""
			}
			- "\" doesn't\n  include information like the actual bitrate (only the maximum bitrate). Thus, given a type, a user\n  agent can often only know whether it "
			em {
				- "might"
			}
			- " be able to play media of that type (with\n  varying levels of confidence), or whether it definitely "
			em {
				- "cannot"
			}
			- " play media of that\n  type."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			dfn id="a-type-that-the-user-agent-knows-it-cannot-render" {
				- "A type that the user agent knows it cannot render"
			}
			- " is one that describes a resource\n  that the user agent definitely does not support, for example because it doesn't recognize the\n  container type, or it doesn't support the listed codecs."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "The "
			a id="mime-types:mime-type-2" href="https://mimesniff.spec.whatwg.org/#mime-type" data-x-internal="mime-type" {
				- "MIME type"
			}
			- " \""
			code id="mime-types:application/octet-stream" {
				a data-x-internal="application/octet-stream" href="https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc2046#section-4.5.1" {
					- "application/octet-stream"
				}
			}
			- "\" with no parameters is never\n  "
			a href="#a-type-that-the-user-agent-knows-it-cannot-render" id="mime-types:a-type-that-the-user-agent-knows-it-cannot-render" {
				- "a type that the user agent knows it cannot render"
			}
			- ". User agents must treat that type\n  as equivalent to the lack of any explicit "
			a href="#content-type" id="mime-types:content-type" {
				- "Content-Type metadata"
			}
			- "\n  when it is used to label a potential "
			a href="#media-resource" id="mime-types:media-resource-2" {
				- "media resource"
			}
			- "."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p class="note" {
			- "Only the "
			a id="mime-types:mime-type-3" href="https://mimesniff.spec.whatwg.org/#mime-type" data-x-internal="mime-type" {
				- "MIME type"
			}
			- " \""
			code id="mime-types:application/octet-stream-2" {
				a data-x-internal="application/octet-stream" href="https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc2046#section-4.5.1" {
					- "application/octet-stream"
				}
			}
			- "\" with no\n  parameters is special-cased here; if any parameter appears with it, it will be treated just like\n  any other "
			a id="mime-types:mime-type-4" href="https://mimesniff.spec.whatwg.org/#mime-type" data-x-internal="mime-type" {
				- "MIME type"
			}
			- ". This is a deviation from the rule  that unknown "
			a id="mime-types:mime-type-5" href="https://mimesniff.spec.whatwg.org/#mime-type" data-x-internal="mime-type" {
				- "MIME type"
			}
			- " parameters should be\n  ignored."
		}
		- " \n\n  "
		dl class="domintro" {
			dt {
				code {
					var {
						- "media"
					}
					- "."
					a href="#dom-navigator-canplaytype" id="dom-navigator-canplaytype-dev" {
						- "canPlayType"
					}
					- "("
					var {
						- "type"
					}
					- ")"
				}
				div class="mdn-anno wrapped before" {
					button onclick="toggleStatus(this)" class="mdn-anno-btn" {
						b title="Support in all current engines." class="all-engines-flag" {
							- "✔"
						}
						span {
							- "MDN"
						}
					}
					div class="feature" {
						p {
							a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/HTMLMediaElement/canPlayType" title="The HTMLMediaElement method canPlayType() reports how likely it is that the current browser will be able to play media of a given MIME type." {
								- "HTMLMediaElement/canPlayType"
							}
						}
						p class="all-engines-text" {
							- "Support in all current engines."
						}
						div class="support" {
							span class="firefox yes" {
								span {
									- "Firefox"
								}
								span {
									- "3.5+"
								}
							}
							span class="safari yes" {
								span {
									- "Safari"
								}
								span {
									- "4+"
								}
							}
							span class="chrome yes" {
								span {
									- "Chrome"
								}
								span {
									- "3+"
								}
							}
							hr
							span class="opera yes" {
								span {
									- "Opera"
								}
								span {
									- "12.1+"
								}
							}
							span class="edge_blink yes" {
								span {
									- "Edge"
								}
								span {
									- "79+"
								}
							}
							hr
							span class="edge yes" {
								span {
									- "Edge (Legacy)"
								}
								span {
									- "12+"
								}
							}
							span class="ie yes" {
								span {
									- "Internet Explorer"
								}
								span {
									- "9+"
								}
							}
							hr
							span class="firefox_android unknown" {
								span {
									- "Firefox Android"
								}
								span {
									- "?"
								}
							}
							span class="safari_ios yes" {
								span {
									- "Safari iOS"
								}
								span {
									- "3+"
								}
							}
							span class="chrome_android unknown" {
								span {
									- "Chrome Android"
								}
								span {
									- "?"
								}
							}
							span class="webview_android yes" {
								span {
									- "WebView Android"
								}
								span {
									- "37+"
								}
							}
							span class="samsunginternet_android unknown" {
								span {
									- "Samsung Internet"
								}
								span {
									- "?"
								}
							}
							span class="opera_android yes" {
								span {
									- "Opera Android"
								}
								span {
									- "12.1+"
								}
							}
						}
					}
				}
			}
			dd {
				- "\n    "
				p {
					- "Returns the empty string (a negative response), \"maybe\", or \"probably\" based on how confident\n    the user agent is that it can play media resources of the given type."
				}
				- "\n   "
			}
		}
		- "\n\n  \n\n  "
		p {
			- "The "
			dfn data-dfn-for="HTMLMediaElement" id="dom-navigator-canplaytype" data-dfn-type="method" {
				code {
					- "canPlayType("
					var {
						- "type"
					}
					- ")"
				}
			}
			- " method must return\n  "
			dfn id="dom-canplaytyperesult-nil" {
				- "the empty string"
			}
			- " if "
			var {
				- "type"
			}
			- " is "
			a href="#a-type-that-the-user-agent-knows-it-cannot-render" id="mime-types:a-type-that-the-user-agent-knows-it-cannot-render-2" {
				- "a type\n  that the user agent knows it cannot render"
			}
			- " or is the type\n  \""
			code id="mime-types:application/octet-stream-3" {
				a data-x-internal="application/octet-stream" href="https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc2046#section-4.5.1" {
					- "application/octet-stream"
				}
			}
			- "\"; it must return \""
			dfn data-dfn-for="CanPlayTypeResult" id="dom-canplaytyperesult-probably" data-dfn-type="enum-value" {
				code {
					- "probably"
				}
			}
			- "\" if\n  the user agent is confident that the type represents a "
			a href="#media-resource" id="mime-types:media-resource-3" {
				- "media resource"
			}
			- " that it can\n  render if used in with this "
			code id="mime-types:the-audio-element" {
				a href="#the-audio-element" {
					- "audio"
				}
			}
			- " or "
			code id="mime-types:the-video-element" {
				a href="#the-video-element" {
					- "video"
				}
			}
			- " element; and it must return\n  \""
			dfn data-dfn-for="CanPlayTypeResult" id="dom-canplaytyperesult-maybe" data-dfn-type="enum-value" {
				code {
					- "maybe"
				}
			}
			- "\" otherwise. Implementers are encouraged to\n  return \""
			code id="mime-types:dom-canplaytyperesult-maybe" {
				a href="#dom-canplaytyperesult-maybe" {
					- "maybe"
				}
			}
			- "\" unless the type can be\n  confidently established as being supported or not. Generally, a user agent should never return\n  \""
			code id="mime-types:dom-canplaytyperesult-probably" {
				a href="#dom-canplaytyperesult-probably" {
					- "probably"
				}
			}
			- "\" for a type that allows the "
			code {
				- "codecs"
			}
			- " parameter if that parameter is not present."
		}
		- "\n\n  \n\n  "
		div class="example" {
			- "\n\n   "
			p {
				- "This script tests to see if the user agent supports a (fictional) new format to dynamically\n   decide whether to use a "
				code id="mime-types:the-video-element-2" {
					a href="#the-video-element" {
						- "video"
					}
				}
				- " element:"
			}
			- "\n\n   "
			pre {
				code class="html" {
					c- p="" {
						- "<"
					}
					c- f="" {
						- "section"
					}
					- " "
					c- e="" {
						- "id"
					}
					c- o="" {
						- "="
					}
					c- s="" {
						- "\"video\""
					}
					c- p="" {
						- ">"
					}
					- "\n "
					c- p="" {
						- "<"
					}
					c- f="" {
						- "p"
					}
					c- p="" {
						- "><"
					}
					c- f="" {
						- "a"
					}
					- " "
					c- e="" {
						- "href"
					}
					c- o="" {
						- "="
					}
					c- s="" {
						- "\"playing-cats.nfv\""
					}
					c- p="" {
						- ">"
					}
					- "Download video"
					c- p="" {
						- "</"
					}
					c- f="" {
						- "a"
					}
					c- p="" {
						- "></"
					}
					c- f="" {
						- "p"
					}
					c- p="" {
						- ">"
					}
					- "\n"
					c- p="" {
						- "</"
					}
					c- f="" {
						- "section"
					}
					c- p="" {
						- ">"
					}
					- "\n"
					c- p="" {
						- "<"
					}
					c- f="" {
						- "script"
					}
					c- p="" {
						- ">"
					}
					- "\n "
					c- a="" {
						- "const"
					}
					- " videoSection "
					c- o="" {
						- "="
					}
					- " document"
					c- p="" {
						- "."
					}
					- "getElementById"
					c- p="" {
						- "("
					}
					c- t="" {
						- "'video'"
					}
					c- p="" {
						- ");"
					}
					- "\n "
					c- a="" {
						- "const"
					}
					- " videoElement "
					c- o="" {
						- "="
					}
					- " document"
					c- p="" {
						- "."
					}
					- "createElement"
					c- p="" {
						- "("
					}
					c- t="" {
						- "'video'"
					}
					c- p="" {
						- ");"
					}
					- "\n "
					c- a="" {
						- "const"
					}
					- " support "
					c- o="" {
						- "="
					}
					- " videoElement"
					c- p="" {
						- "."
					}
					- "canPlayType"
					c- p="" {
						- "("
					}
					c- t="" {
						- "'video/x-new-fictional-format;codecs=\"kittens,bunnies\"'"
					}
					c- p="" {
						- ");"
					}
					- "\n "
					c- k="" {
						- "if"
					}
					- " "
					c- p="" {
						- "("
					}
					- "support "
					c- o="" {
						- "==="
					}
					- " "
					c- u="" {
						- "\"probably\""
					}
					c- p="" {
						- ")"
					}
					- " "
					c- p="" {
						- "{"
					}
					- "\n   videoElement"
					c- p="" {
						- "."
					}
					- "setAttribute"
					c- p="" {
						- "("
					}
					c- u="" {
						- "\"src\""
					}
					c- p="" {
						- ","
					}
					- " "
					c- u="" {
						- "\"playing-cats.nfv\""
					}
					c- p="" {
						- ");"
					}
					- "\n   videoSection"
					c- p="" {
						- "."
					}
					- "replaceChildren"
					c- p="" {
						- "("
					}
					- "videoElement"
					c- p="" {
						- ");"
					}
					- "\n "
					c- p="" {
						- "}"
					}
					- "\n"
					c- p="" {
						- "</"
					}
					c- f="" {
						- "script"
					}
					c- p="" {
						- ">"
					}
				}
			}
			- "\n\n  "
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p class="note" {
			- "The "
			code id="mime-types:attr-source-type" {
				a href="#attr-source-type" {
					- "type"
				}
			}
			- " attribute of the\n  "
			code id="mime-types:the-source-element" {
				a href="#the-source-element" {
					- "source"
				}
			}
			- " element allows the user agent to avoid downloading resources that use formats\n  it cannot render."
		}
		- "\n\n\n  "
		h5 id="network-states" {
			span class="secno" {
				- "4.8.11.4"
			}
			- " Network states"
			a href="#network-states" class="self-link"
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		dl class="domintro" {
			dt {
				code {
					var {
						- "media"
					}
					- "."
					a href="#dom-media-networkstate" id="dom-media-networkstate-dev" {
						- "networkState"
					}
				}
				div class="mdn-anno wrapped before" {
					button onclick="toggleStatus(this)" class="mdn-anno-btn" {
						b title="Support in all current engines." class="all-engines-flag" {
							- "✔"
						}
						span {
							- "MDN"
						}
					}
					div class="feature" {
						p {
							a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/HTMLMediaElement/networkState" title="The HTMLMediaElement.networkState property indicates the current state of the fetching of media over the network." {
								- "HTMLMediaElement/networkState"
							}
						}
						p class="all-engines-text" {
							- "Support in all current engines."
						}
						div class="support" {
							span class="firefox yes" {
								span {
									- "Firefox"
								}
								span {
									- "3.5+"
								}
							}
							span class="safari yes" {
								span {
									- "Safari"
								}
								span {
									- "3.1+"
								}
							}
							span class="chrome yes" {
								span {
									- "Chrome"
								}
								span {
									- "3+"
								}
							}
							hr
							span class="opera yes" {
								span {
									- "Opera"
								}
								span {
									- "12.1+"
								}
							}
							span class="edge_blink yes" {
								span {
									- "Edge"
								}
								span {
									- "79+"
								}
							}
							hr
							span class="edge yes" {
								span {
									- "Edge (Legacy)"
								}
								span {
									- "12+"
								}
							}
							span class="ie yes" {
								span {
									- "Internet Explorer"
								}
								span {
									- "9+"
								}
							}
							hr
							span class="firefox_android yes" {
								span {
									- "Firefox Android"
								}
								span {
									- "4+"
								}
							}
							span class="safari_ios yes" {
								span {
									- "Safari iOS"
								}
								span {
									- "3+"
								}
							}
							span class="chrome_android unknown" {
								span {
									- "Chrome Android"
								}
								span {
									- "?"
								}
							}
							span class="webview_android yes" {
								span {
									- "WebView Android"
								}
								span {
									- "37+"
								}
							}
							span class="samsunginternet_android unknown" {
								span {
									- "Samsung Internet"
								}
								span {
									- "?"
								}
							}
							span class="opera_android yes" {
								span {
									- "Opera Android"
								}
								span {
									- "12.1+"
								}
							}
						}
					}
				}
			}
			dd {
				- "\n    "
				p {
					- "Returns the current state of network activity for the element, from the codes in the list\n    below."
				}
				- "\n   "
			}
		}
		- "\n\n  \n\n  "
		p {
			- "As "
			a href="#media-element" id="network-states:media-element" {
				- "media elements"
			}
			- " interact with the network, their current\n  network activity is represented by the "
			dfn data-dfn-for="HTMLMediaElement" id="dom-media-networkstate" data-dfn-type="attribute" {
				code {
					- "networkState"
				}
			}
			- " attribute. On getting, it must return\n  the current network state of the element, which must be one of the following values:"
		}
		- "\n\n  \n\n  "
		dl {
			dt {
				dfn data-dfn-for="HTMLMediaElement" id="dom-media-network_empty" data-dfn-type="const" {
					code {
						- "NETWORK_EMPTY"
					}
				}
				- " (numeric value 0)"
			}
			dd {
				- "The element has not yet been initialized. All attributes are in their initial states."
			}
			dt {
				dfn data-dfn-for="HTMLMediaElement" id="dom-media-network_idle" data-dfn-type="const" {
					code {
						- "NETWORK_IDLE"
					}
				}
				- " (numeric value 1)"
			}
			dd {
				- "The element's "
				a href="#concept-media-load-algorithm" id="network-states:concept-media-load-algorithm" {
					- "resource\n   selection algorithm"
				}
				- " is active and has selected a "
				a href="#media-resource" id="network-states:media-resource" {
					- "resource"
				}
				- ", but it is not actually using the network at this time."
			}
			dt {
				dfn data-dfn-for="HTMLMediaElement" id="dom-media-network_loading" data-dfn-type="const" {
					code {
						- "NETWORK_LOADING"
					}
				}
				- " (numeric value 2)"
			}
			dd {
				- "The user agent is actively trying to download data."
			}
			dt {
				dfn data-dfn-for="HTMLMediaElement" id="dom-media-network_no_source" data-dfn-type="const" {
					code {
						- "NETWORK_NO_SOURCE"
					}
				}
				- " (numeric value 3)"
			}
			dd {
				- "The element's "
				a href="#concept-media-load-algorithm" id="network-states:concept-media-load-algorithm-2" {
					- "resource\n   selection algorithm"
				}
				- " is active, but it has not yet found a "
				a href="#media-resource" id="network-states:media-resource-2" {
					- "resource"
				}
				- " to use."
			}
		}
		- "\n\n  \n\n  "
		p {
			- "The "
			a href="#concept-media-load-algorithm" id="network-states:concept-media-load-algorithm-3" {
				- "resource selection algorithm"
			}
			- " defined\n  below describes exactly when the "
			code id="network-states:dom-media-networkstate" {
				a href="#dom-media-networkstate" {
					- "networkState"
				}
			}
			- "\n  attribute changes value and what events fire to indicate changes in this state."
		}
		- "\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n  "
		h5 id="loading-the-media-resource" {
			span class="secno" {
				- "4.8.11.5"
			}
			- " Loading the media resource"
			a href="#loading-the-media-resource" class="self-link"
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		dl class="domintro" {
			dt {
				code {
					var {
						- "media"
					}
					- "."
					a href="#dom-media-load" id="dom-media-load-dev" {
						- "load"
					}
					- "()"
				}
				div class="mdn-anno wrapped before" {
					button onclick="toggleStatus(this)" class="mdn-anno-btn" {
						b title="Support in all current engines." class="all-engines-flag" {
							- "✔"
						}
						span {
							- "MDN"
						}
					}
					div class="feature" {
						p {
							a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/HTMLMediaElement/load" title="The HTMLMediaElement method load() resets the media element to its initial state and begins the process of selecting a media source and loading the media in preparation for playback to begin at the beginning." {
								- "HTMLMediaElement/load"
							}
						}
						p class="all-engines-text" {
							- "Support in all current engines."
						}
						div class="support" {
							span class="firefox yes" {
								span {
									- "Firefox"
								}
								span {
									- "3.5+"
								}
							}
							span class="safari yes" {
								span {
									- "Safari"
								}
								span {
									- "3.1+"
								}
							}
							span class="chrome yes" {
								span {
									- "Chrome"
								}
								span {
									- "3+"
								}
							}
							hr
							span class="opera yes" {
								span {
									- "Opera"
								}
								span {
									- "12.1+"
								}
							}
							span class="edge_blink yes" {
								span {
									- "Edge"
								}
								span {
									- "79+"
								}
							}
							hr
							span class="edge yes" {
								span {
									- "Edge (Legacy)"
								}
								span {
									- "12+"
								}
							}
							span class="ie yes" {
								span {
									- "Internet Explorer"
								}
								span {
									- "9+"
								}
							}
							hr
							span class="firefox_android unknown" {
								span {
									- "Firefox Android"
								}
								span {
									- "?"
								}
							}
							span class="safari_ios yes" {
								span {
									- "Safari iOS"
								}
								span {
									- "3+"
								}
							}
							span class="chrome_android unknown" {
								span {
									- "Chrome Android"
								}
								span {
									- "?"
								}
							}
							span class="webview_android yes" {
								span {
									- "WebView Android"
								}
								span {
									- "37+"
								}
							}
							span class="samsunginternet_android unknown" {
								span {
									- "Samsung Internet"
								}
								span {
									- "?"
								}
							}
							span class="opera_android yes" {
								span {
									- "Opera Android"
								}
								span {
									- "12.1+"
								}
							}
						}
					}
				}
			}
			dd {
				- "\n    "
				p {
					- "Causes the element to reset and start selecting and loading a new "
					a href="#media-resource" id="loading-the-media-resource:media-resource" {
						- "media resource"
					}
					- "\n    from scratch."
				}
				- "\n   "
			}
		}
		- "\n\n  \n\n  "
		p {
			- "All "
			a href="#media-element" id="loading-the-media-resource:media-element" {
				- "media elements"
			}
			- " have a "
			dfn id="can-autoplay-flag" {
				- "can autoplay flag"
			}
			- ",\n  which must begin in the true state, and a "
			dfn id="delaying-the-load-event-flag" {
				- "delaying-the-load-event flag"
			}
			- ", which must\n  begin in the false state. While the "
			a href="#delaying-the-load-event-flag" id="loading-the-media-resource:delaying-the-load-event-flag" {
				- "delaying-the-load-event flag"
			}
			- " is true, the element\n  must "
			a href="#delay-the-load-event" id="loading-the-media-resource:delay-the-load-event" {
				- "delay the load event"
			}
			- " of its document."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "When the "
			dfn data-dfn-for="HTMLMediaElement" id="dom-media-load" data-dfn-type="method" {
				code {
					- "load()"
				}
			}
			- "\n  method on a "
			a href="#media-element" id="loading-the-media-resource:media-element-2" {
				- "media element"
			}
			- " is invoked, the user agent must run the "
			a href="#media-element-load-algorithm" id="loading-the-media-resource:media-element-load-algorithm" {
				- "media element\n  load algorithm"
			}
			- "."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "A "
			a href="#media-element" id="loading-the-media-resource:media-element-3" {
				- "media element"
			}
			- " has an associated boolean "
			dfn id="is-currently-stalled" {
				- "is currently stalled"
			}
			- ", which\n  is initially false."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "The "
			dfn id="media-element-load-algorithm" {
				- "media element load algorithm"
			}
			- " consists of the following steps."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		ol {
			li {
				p {
					- "Set this element's "
					a href="#is-currently-stalled" id="loading-the-media-resource:is-currently-stalled" {
						- "is currently stalled"
					}
					- " to false."
				}
			}
			li {
				p {
					- "Abort any already-running instance of the "
					a href="#concept-media-load-algorithm" id="loading-the-media-resource:concept-media-load-algorithm" {
						- "resource selection algorithm"
					}
					- " for this\n   element."
				}
			}
			li {
				p {
					- "Let "
					var {
						- "pending tasks"
					}
					- " be a list of all "
					a href="#concept-task" id="loading-the-media-resource:concept-task" {
						- "tasks"
					}
					- "\n   from the "
					a href="#media-element" id="loading-the-media-resource:media-element-4" {
						- "media element"
					}
					- "'s "
					a href="#media-element-event-task-source" id="loading-the-media-resource:media-element-event-task-source" {
						- "media element event task source"
					}
					- " in one of the\n   "
					a href="#task-queue" id="loading-the-media-resource:task-queue" {
						- "task queues"
					}
					- "."
				}
			}
			li {
				p {
					- "For each task in "
					var {
						- "pending tasks"
					}
					- " that would "
					a href="#resolve-pending-play-promises" id="loading-the-media-resource:resolve-pending-play-promises" {
						- "resolve pending play\n   promises"
					}
					- " or "
					a href="#reject-pending-play-promises" id="loading-the-media-resource:reject-pending-play-promises" {
						- "reject pending play promises"
					}
					- ", immediately resolve or reject those\n   promises in the order the corresponding tasks were queued."
				}
			}
			li {
				- "\n    "
				p {
					- "Remove each "
					a href="#concept-task" id="loading-the-media-resource:concept-task-2" {
						- "task"
					}
					- " in "
					var {
						- "pending tasks"
					}
					- " from its\n    "
					a href="#task-queue" id="loading-the-media-resource:task-queue-2" {
						- "task queue"
					}
					- "."
				}
				- "\n\n    "
				p class="note" {
					- "Basically, pending events and callbacks are discarded and promises in-flight to\n    be resolved/rejected are resolved/rejected immediately when the media element starts loading a\n    new resource."
				}
				- "\n   "
			}
			li {
				p {
					- "If the "
					a href="#media-element" id="loading-the-media-resource:media-element-5" {
						- "media element"
					}
					- "'s "
					code id="loading-the-media-resource:dom-media-networkstate" {
						a href="#dom-media-networkstate" {
							- "networkState"
						}
					}
					- " is set to "
					code id="loading-the-media-resource:dom-media-network_loading" {
						a href="#dom-media-network_loading" {
							- "NETWORK_LOADING"
						}
					}
					- " or "
					code id="loading-the-media-resource:dom-media-network_idle" {
						a href="#dom-media-network_idle" {
							- "NETWORK_IDLE"
						}
					}
					- ", "
					a href="#queue-a-media-element-task" id="loading-the-media-resource:queue-a-media-element-task" {
						- "queue a media element task"
					}
					- "\n   given the "
					a href="#media-element" id="loading-the-media-resource:media-element-6" {
						- "media element"
					}
					- " to "
					a href="https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-event-fire" id="loading-the-media-resource:concept-event-fire" data-x-internal="concept-event-fire" {
						- "fire an event"
					}
					- "\n   named "
					code id="loading-the-media-resource:event-media-abort" {
						a href="#event-media-abort" {
							- "abort"
						}
					}
					- " at the "
					a href="#media-element" id="loading-the-media-resource:media-element-7" {
						- "media element"
					}
					- "."
				}
			}
			li {
				- "\n    "
				p {
					- "If the "
					a href="#media-element" id="loading-the-media-resource:media-element-8" {
						- "media element"
					}
					- "'s "
					code id="loading-the-media-resource:dom-media-networkstate-2" {
						a href="#dom-media-networkstate" {
							- "networkState"
						}
					}
					- "\n    is not set to "
					code id="loading-the-media-resource:dom-media-network_empty" {
						a href="#dom-media-network_empty" {
							- "NETWORK_EMPTY"
						}
					}
					- ", then:"
				}
				- "\n\n    "
				ol {
					li {
						p {
							a href="#queue-a-media-element-task" id="loading-the-media-resource:queue-a-media-element-task-2" {
								- "Queue a media element task"
							}
							- " given the "
							a href="#media-element" id="loading-the-media-resource:media-element-9" {
								- "media element"
							}
							- " to "
							a href="https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-event-fire" id="loading-the-media-resource:concept-event-fire-2" data-x-internal="concept-event-fire" {
								- "fire an event"
							}
							- " named "
							code id="loading-the-media-resource:event-media-emptied" {
								a href="#event-media-emptied" {
									- "emptied"
								}
							}
							- " at the "
							a href="#media-element" id="loading-the-media-resource:media-element-10" {
								- "media element"
							}
							- "."
						}
					}
					li {
						p {
							- "If a fetching process is in progress for the "
							a href="#media-element" id="loading-the-media-resource:media-element-11" {
								- "media\n     element"
							}
							- ", the user agent should stop it."
						}
					}
					li {
						p {
							- "If the "
							a href="#media-element" id="loading-the-media-resource:media-element-12" {
								- "media element"
							}
							- "'s "
							a href="#assigned-media-provider-object" id="loading-the-media-resource:assigned-media-provider-object" {
								- "assigned media provider object"
							}
							- " is a\n     "
							code id="loading-the-media-resource:mediasource" {
								a data-x-internal="mediasource" href="https://w3c.github.io/media-source/#idl-def-mediasource" {
									- "MediaSource"
								}
							}
							- " object, then "
							a href="https://w3c.github.io/media-source/#mediasource-detach" id="loading-the-media-resource:detaching-from-a-media-element" data-x-internal="detaching-from-a-media-element" {
								- "detach"
							}
							- " it."
						}
					}
					li {
						p {
							a href="#forget-the-media-element's-media-resource-specific-tracks" id="loading-the-media-resource:forget-the-media-element's-media-resource-specific-tracks" {
								- "Forget the media element's media-resource-specific tracks"
							}
							- "."
						}
					}
					li {
						p {
							- "If "
							code id="loading-the-media-resource:dom-media-readystate" {
								a href="#dom-media-readystate" {
									- "readyState"
								}
							}
							- " is not set to "
							code id="loading-the-media-resource:dom-media-have_nothing" {
								a href="#dom-media-have_nothing" {
									- "HAVE_NOTHING"
								}
							}
							- ", then set it to that state."
						}
					}
					li {
						- "\n     "
						p {
							- "If the "
							code id="loading-the-media-resource:dom-media-paused" {
								a href="#dom-media-paused" {
									- "paused"
								}
							}
							- " attribute is false, then:"
						}
						- "\n\n      "
						ol {
							li {
								p {
									- "Set the "
									code id="loading-the-media-resource:dom-media-paused-2" {
										a href="#dom-media-paused" {
											- "paused"
										}
									}
									- " attribute to true."
								}
							}
							li {
								p {
									a href="#take-pending-play-promises" id="loading-the-media-resource:take-pending-play-promises" {
										- "Take pending play promises"
									}
									- " and "
									a href="#reject-pending-play-promises" id="loading-the-media-resource:reject-pending-play-promises-2" {
										- "reject pending play promises"
									}
									- "\n       with the result and an "
									a id="loading-the-media-resource:aborterror" href="https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#aborterror" data-x-internal="aborterror" {
										- "\""
										code {
											- "AbortError"
										}
										- "\""
									}
									- "\n       "
									code id="loading-the-media-resource:domexception" {
										a data-x-internal="domexception" href="https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#dfn-DOMException" {
											- "DOMException"
										}
									}
									- "."
								}
							}
						}
						- "\n     "
					}
					li {
						p {
							- "If "
							code id="loading-the-media-resource:dom-media-seeking" {
								a href="#dom-media-seeking" {
									- "seeking"
								}
							}
							- " is true, set it to false."
						}
					}
					li {
						- "\n      "
						p {
							- "Set the "
							a href="#current-playback-position" id="loading-the-media-resource:current-playback-position" {
								- "current playback position"
							}
							- " to 0."
						}
						- "\n\n      "
						p {
							- "Set the "
							a href="#official-playback-position" id="loading-the-media-resource:official-playback-position" {
								- "official playback position"
							}
							- " to 0."
						}
						- "\n\n      "
						p {
							- "If this changed the "
							a href="#official-playback-position" id="loading-the-media-resource:official-playback-position-2" {
								- "official playback position"
							}
							- ", then "
							a href="#queue-a-media-element-task" id="loading-the-media-resource:queue-a-media-element-task-3" {
								- "queue a media\n      element task"
							}
							- " given the "
							a href="#media-element" id="loading-the-media-resource:media-element-13" {
								- "media element"
							}
							- " to "
							a href="https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-event-fire" id="loading-the-media-resource:concept-event-fire-3" data-x-internal="concept-event-fire" {
								- "fire an event"
							}
							- " named "
							code id="loading-the-media-resource:event-media-timeupdate" {
								a href="#event-media-timeupdate" {
									- "timeupdate"
								}
							}
							- " at the "
							a href="#media-element" id="loading-the-media-resource:media-element-14" {
								- "media element"
							}
							- "."
						}
						- "\n     "
					}
					li {
						p {
							- "Set the "
							a href="#timeline-offset" id="loading-the-media-resource:timeline-offset" {
								- "timeline offset"
							}
							- " to Not-a-Number (NaN)."
						}
					}
					li {
						- "\n      "
						p {
							- "Update the "
							code id="loading-the-media-resource:dom-media-duration" {
								a href="#dom-media-duration" {
									- "duration"
								}
							}
							- " attribute to Not-a-Number\n      (NaN)."
						}
						- "\n\n      "
						p class="note" {
							- "The user agent "
							a href="#durationChange" {
								- "will not"
							}
							- " fire a "
							code id="loading-the-media-resource:event-media-durationchange" {
								a href="#event-media-durationchange" {
									- "durationchange"
								}
							}
							- " event for this particular change of\n      the duration."
						}
						- "\n     "
					}
				}
				- "\n   "
			}
			li {
				p {
					- "Set the "
					code id="loading-the-media-resource:dom-media-playbackrate" {
						a href="#dom-media-playbackrate" {
							- "playbackRate"
						}
					}
					- " attribute to the value of\n   the "
					code id="loading-the-media-resource:dom-media-defaultplaybackrate" {
						a href="#dom-media-defaultplaybackrate" {
							- "defaultPlaybackRate"
						}
					}
					- " attribute."
				}
			}
			li {
				p {
					- "Set the "
					code id="loading-the-media-resource:dom-media-error" {
						a href="#dom-media-error" {
							- "error"
						}
					}
					- " attribute to null and the\n   "
					a href="#can-autoplay-flag" id="loading-the-media-resource:can-autoplay-flag" {
						- "can autoplay flag"
					}
					- " to true."
				}
			}
			li {
				p {
					- "Invoke the "
					a href="#media-element" id="loading-the-media-resource:media-element-15" {
						- "media element"
					}
					- "'s "
					a href="#concept-media-load-algorithm" id="loading-the-media-resource:concept-media-load-algorithm-2" {
						- "resource selection algorithm"
					}
					- "."
				}
			}
			li {
				- "\n    "
				p class="note" {
					- "Playback of any previously playing "
					a href="#media-resource" id="loading-the-media-resource:media-resource-2" {
						- "media resource"
					}
					- " for this element\n    stops."
				}
				- "\n   "
			}
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "The "
			dfn id="concept-media-load-algorithm" {
				- "resource selection algorithm"
			}
			- " for a\n  "
			a href="#media-element" id="loading-the-media-resource:media-element-16" {
				- "media element"
			}
			- " is as follows. This algorithm is always invoked as part of a "
			a href="#concept-task" id="loading-the-media-resource:concept-task-3" {
				- "task"
			}
			- ", but one\n  of the first steps in the algorithm is to return and continue running the remaining steps\n  "
			a href="#in-parallel" id="loading-the-media-resource:in-parallel" {
				- "in parallel"
			}
			- ". In addition, this algorithm interacts\n  closely with the "
			a href="#event-loop" id="loading-the-media-resource:event-loop" {
				- "event loop"
			}
			- " mechanism; in particular, it has "
			a href="#synchronous-section" id="loading-the-media-resource:synchronous-section" {
				- "synchronous sections"
			}
			- " (which are triggered as part of the "
			a href="#event-loop" id="loading-the-media-resource:event-loop-2" {
				- "event loop"
			}
			- "\n  algorithm). Steps in such sections are marked with ⌛."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		ol {
			li {
				p {
					- "Set the element's "
					code id="loading-the-media-resource:dom-media-networkstate-3" {
						a href="#dom-media-networkstate" {
							- "networkState"
						}
					}
					- " attribute to\n   the "
					code id="loading-the-media-resource:dom-media-network_no_source" {
						a href="#dom-media-network_no_source" {
							- "NETWORK_NO_SOURCE"
						}
					}
					- " value."
				}
			}
			li {
				p {
					- "Set the element's "
					a href="#show-poster-flag" id="loading-the-media-resource:show-poster-flag" {
						- "show poster flag"
					}
					- " to true."
				}
			}
			li {
				p {
					- "Set the "
					a href="#media-element" id="loading-the-media-resource:media-element-17" {
						- "media element"
					}
					- "'s "
					a href="#delaying-the-load-event-flag" id="loading-the-media-resource:delaying-the-load-event-flag-2" {
						- "delaying-the-load-event flag"
					}
					- " to true\n   (this "
					a href="#delay-the-load-event" id="loading-the-media-resource:delay-the-load-event-2" {
						- "delays the load event"
					}
					- ")."
				}
			}
			li {
				p {
					a href="#await-a-stable-state" id="loading-the-media-resource:await-a-stable-state" {
						- "Await a stable state"
					}
					- ", allowing the "
					a href="#concept-task" id="loading-the-media-resource:concept-task-4" {
						- "task"
					}
