						- "loaded"
					}
					- "."
				}
			}
			li {
				p {
					- "Set the new "
					a href="#text-track" id="sourcing-in-band-text-tracks:text-track-10" {
						- "text track"
					}
					- "'s "
					a href="#text-track-mode" id="sourcing-in-band-text-tracks:text-track-mode" {
						- "mode"
					}
					- " to the\n   mode consistent with the user's preferences and the requirements of the relevant specification\n   for the data."
				}
				- "\n\n    "
				p class="note" {
					- "For instance, if there are no other active subtitles, and this is a forced\n    subtitle track (a subtitle track giving subtitles in the audio track's primary language, but\n    only for audio that is actually in another language), then those subtitles might be activated\n    here."
				}
