			}
			- " is initially empty. It is dynamically modified when\n  the referenced file is parsed. Associated with the list are the "
			a href="#rules-for-updating-the-text-track-rendering" id="sourcing-out-of-band-text-tracks:rules-for-updating-the-text-track-rendering" {
				- "rules for updating the text\n  track rendering"
