					var {
						- "volume"
					}
					- ", interpreted relative to the range 0.0 to 1.0, with 0.0 being\n   silent, and 1.0 being the loudest setting, values in between increasing in loudness. The range\n   need not be linear. The loudest setting may be lower than the system's loudest possible setting;\n   for example the user could have set a maximum volume."
