			- " element has an "
			code id="the-area-element:attr-hyperlink-href-3" {
				a href="#attr-hyperlink-href" {
					- "href"
				}
			}
			- "\n  attribute, then the "
			code id="the-area-element:the-area-element-4" {
				a href="#the-area-element" {
					- "area"
				}
			}
			- " element represents a "
			a href="#hyperlink" id="the-area-element:hyperlink-4" {
				- "hyperlink"
			}
			- ". In this case,\n  the "
			dfn data-dfn-for="area" id="attr-area-alt" data-dfn-type="element-attr" {
				code {
					- "alt"
				}
			}
			- " attribute must be\n  present. It specifies the text of the hyperlink. Its value must be text that, when presented with\n  the texts specified for the other hyperlinks of the "
			a href="#image-map" id="the-area-element:image-map-4" {
				- "image map"
			}
			- ", and with the\n  alternative text of the image, but without the image itself, provides the user with the same kind\n  of choice as the hyperlink would when used without its text but with its shape applied to the\n  image. The "
			code id="the-area-element:attr-area-alt-2" {
				a href="#attr-area-alt" {
					- "alt"
				}
			}
			- " attribute may be left blank if there is another\n  "
			code id="the-area-element:the-area-element-5" {
				a href="#the-area-element" {
					- "area"
				}
			}
			- " element in the same "
			a href="#image-map" id="the-area-element:image-map-5" {
				- "image map"
			}
			- " that points to the same resource and\n  has a non-blank "
			code id="the-area-element:attr-area-alt-3" {
				a href="#attr-area-alt" {
					- "alt"
				}
			}
			- " attribute."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "If the "
			code id="the-area-element:the-area-element-6" {
				a href="#the-area-element" {
					- "area"
				}
			}
			- " element has no "
			code id="the-area-element:attr-hyperlink-href-4" {
				a href="#attr-hyperlink-href" {
					- "href"
				}
			}
			- "\n  attribute, then the area represented by the element cannot be selected, and the "
			code id="the-area-element:attr-area-alt-4" {
				a href="#attr-area-alt" {
					- "alt"
				}
			}
			- " attribute must be omitted."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "In both cases, the "
			code id="the-area-element:attr-area-shape-2" {
				a href="#attr-area-shape" {
					- "shape"
				}
			}
			- " and "
			code id="the-area-element:attr-area-coords-2" {
				a href="#attr-area-coords" {
					- "coords"
				}
			}
			- " attributes specify the area."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "The "
			dfn data-dfn-for="area" id="attr-area-shape" data-dfn-type="element-attr" {
				code {
					- "shape"
				}
			}
			- " attribute is\n  an "
			a href="#enumerated-attribute" id="the-area-element:enumerated-attribute" {
				- "enumerated attribute"
			}
			- " with the following keywords and states:"
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		table class="yesno" {
			thead {
				tr {
					th {
						- "Keyword\n     "
					}
					th {
						- "Conforming\n     "
					}
					th {
						- "State\n     "
					}
					th {
						- "Brief description\n   "
					}
				}
			}
			tbody {
				tr {
					td {
						dfn id="attr-area-shape-keyword-circle" {
							code {
								- "circle"
							}
						}
						- "\n     "
					}
					td {
						- "\n     "
					}
					td rowspan="2" {
						a href="#attr-area-shape-circle" id="the-area-element:attr-area-shape-circle" {
							- "Circle state"
						}
						- "\n     "
					}
					td rowspan="2" {
						- "Designates a circle, using exactly three integers in the "
						code id="the-area-element:attr-area-coords-3" {
							a href="#attr-area-coords" {
								- "coords"
							}
						}
						- " attribute.\n    "
					}
				}
				tr {
					td {
						dfn id="attr-area-shape-keyword-circ" {
							code {
								- "circ"
							}
						}
						- "\n     "
					}
					td class="no" {
						- "No\n    "
					}
				}
				tr {
					td {
						dfn id="attr-area-shape-keyword-default" {
							code {
								- "default"
							}
						}
						- "\n     "
					}
					td {
						- "\n     "
					}
					td {
						a href="#attr-area-shape-default" id="the-area-element:attr-area-shape-default" {
							- "Default state"
						}
						- "\n     "
					}
					td {
						- "This area is the whole image. (The "
						code id="the-area-element:attr-area-coords-4" {
							a href="#attr-area-coords" {
								- "coords"
							}
						}
						- "\n     attribute is not used.)\n    "
					}
				}
				tr {
					td {
						dfn id="attr-area-shape-keyword-poly" {
							code {
								- "poly"
							}
						}
						- "\n     "
					}
					td {
						- "\n     "
					}
					td rowspan="2" {
						a href="#attr-area-shape-poly" id="the-area-element:attr-area-shape-poly" {
							- "Polygon state"
						}
						- "\n     "
					}
					td rowspan="2" {
						- "Designates a polygon, using at-least six integers in the "
						code id="the-area-element:attr-area-coords-5" {
							a href="#attr-area-coords" {
								- "coords"
							}
						}
						- " attribute.\n    "
					}
				}
				tr {
					td {
						dfn id="attr-area-shape-keyword-polygon" {
							code {
								- "polygon"
							}
						}
						- "\n     "
					}
					td class="no" {
						- "No\n    "
					}
				}
				tr {
					td {
						dfn id="attr-area-shape-keyword-rect" {
							code {
								- "rect"
							}
						}
						- "\n     "
					}
					td {
						- "\n     "
					}
					td rowspan="2" {
						a href="#attr-area-shape-rect" id="the-area-element:attr-area-shape-rect" {
							- "Rectangle state"
						}
						- "\n     "
					}
					td rowspan="2" {
						- "Designates a rectangle, using exactly four integers in the "
						code id="the-area-element:attr-area-coords-6" {
							a href="#attr-area-coords" {
								- "coords"
							}
						}
						- " attribute.\n    "
