			div class="feature" {
				p {
					a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/Guide/HTML/HTML5/HTML5_Parser#Inline_SVG_and_MathML_support" title="To build websites, you should know about HTML — the fundamental technology used to define the structure of a webpage. HTML is used to specify whether your web content should be recognized as a paragraph, list, heading, link, image, multimedia player, form, or one of many other available elements or even a new element that you define." {
						- "HTML/HTML5/HTML5_Parser#Inline_SVG_and_MathML_support"
					}
				}
