		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "Authors may also use other techniques, or combinations of the above techniques, as\n  appropriate."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "The best option, of course, rather than writing a description explaining the way the table is\n  laid out, is to adjust the table such that no explanation is needed."
