		- "\n\n\n  "
		h5 id="improving-the-user-experience-on-mobile-devices" {
			span class="secno" {
				- "4.10.1.6"
			}
			- " Improving the user experience on mobile devices"
			a href="#improving-the-user-experience-on-mobile-devices" class="self-link"
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			i {
				- "This section is non-normative."
			}
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "Some devices, in particular those with virtual keyboards can provide the user with multiple\n  input modalities. For example, when typing in a credit card number the user may wish to only see\n  keys for digits 0-9, while when typing in their name they may wish to see a form field that by\n  default capitalizes each word."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "Using the "
			code id="improving-the-user-experience-on-mobile-devices:attr-inputmode" {
				a href="#attr-inputmode" {
					- "inputmode"
				}
			}
			- " attribute we can select appropriate\n  input modalities:"
		}
		- "\n\n  "
