			a href="#set-of-comma-separated-tokens" id="email-state-(type=email):set-of-comma-separated-tokens" {
				- "set of\n  comma-separated tokens"
			}
			- ", where each token is itself a "
			a href="#valid-e-mail-address" id="email-state-(type=email):valid-e-mail-address-5" {
				- "valid email address"
			}
			- ".\n  To obtain the list of tokens from a "
			a href="#valid-e-mail-address-list" id="email-state-(type=email):valid-e-mail-address-list-3" {
				- "valid email address list"
			}
			- ", an\n  implementation must "
