			p {
				- "Note how the UA determined the orientation of the control from the ratio of the\n   style-sheet-specified height and width properties. The colors were similarly derived from the\n   style sheet. The tick marks, however, were derived from the markup. In particular, the "
				code id="range-state-(type=range):attr-input-step" {
