			p {
				- "To avoid confusion as to whether a "
				a href="#radio-button-group" id="the-required-attribute:radio-button-group-2" {
					- "radio button group"
				}
				- " is required or not, authors\n   are encouraged to specify the attribute on all the radio buttons in a group. Indeed, in general,\n   authors are encouraged to avoid having radio button groups that do not have any initially checked\n   controls in the first place, as this is a state that the user cannot return to, and is therefore\n   generally considered a poor user interface."
			}
