		p {
			- "The "
			dfn data-dfn-for="input" id="attr-input-placeholder" data-dfn-type="element-attr" {
				code {
					- "placeholder"
				}
			}
			- " attribute represents a "
			em {
				- "short"
			}
			- "\n  hint (a word or short phrase) intended to aid the user with data entry when the control has no\n  value. A hint could be a sample value or a brief description of the expected format. The\n  attribute, if specified, must have a value that contains no U+000A LINE FEED (LF) or U+000D\n  CARRIAGE RETURN (CR) characters."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "The "
			code id="the-placeholder-attribute:attr-input-placeholder-2" {
				a href="#attr-input-placeholder" {
					- "placeholder"
				}
			}
			- " attribute should not be used as an\n  alternative to a "
			code id="the-placeholder-attribute:the-label-element" {
				a href="#the-label-element" {
					- "label"
				}
			}
			- ". For a longer hint or other advisory text, the "
			code id="the-placeholder-attribute:attr-title" {
				a href="#attr-title" {
					- "title"
				}
			}
			- " attribute is more appropriate."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p class="note" {
			- "These mechanisms are very similar but subtly different: the hint given by the\n  control's "
			code id="the-placeholder-attribute:the-label-element-2" {
				a href="#the-label-element" {
					- "label"
				}
			}
			- " is shown at all times; the short hint given in the "
			code id="the-placeholder-attribute:attr-input-placeholder-3" {
				a href="#attr-input-placeholder" {
					- "placeholder"
				}
			}
			- " attribute is shown before the user enters a\n  value; and the hint in the "
			code id="the-placeholder-attribute:attr-title-2" {
				a href="#attr-title" {
					- "title"
				}
			}
			- " attribute is shown when the user\n  requests further help."
		}
		- "\n\n  \n\n  "
		p {
			- "User agents should present this hint to the user, after having "
			a href="https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#strip-newlines" id="the-placeholder-attribute:strip-newlines" data-x-internal="strip-newlines" {
				- "stripped newlines"
			}
			- " from it, when the element's "
			a href="#concept-fe-value" id="the-placeholder-attribute:concept-fe-value" {
				- "value"
			}
			- " is the empty string, especially if the control is not\n  "
			a href="#focused" id="the-placeholder-attribute:focused" {
				- "focused"
			}
			- "."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "If a user agent normally doesn't show this hint to the user when the control is\n  "
			a href="#focused" id="the-placeholder-attribute:focused-2" {
				- "focused"
			}
			- ", then the user agent should nonetheless show the hint for the control if it\n  was focused as a result of the "
			code id="the-placeholder-attribute:attr-fe-autofocus" {
				a href="#attr-fe-autofocus" {
					- "autofocus"
				}
			}
			- " attribute, since\n  in that case the user will not have had an opportunity to examine the control before focusing\n  it."
		}
