				}
			}
			- " attribute is specified, a number\n  from 0 to the value of the "
			code id="the-progress-element:attr-progress-max-3" {
				a href="#attr-progress-max" {
					- "max"
				}
			}
			- " attribute). To make an\n  indeterminate progress bar, remove the "
			code id="the-progress-element:attr-progress-value-3" {
