		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "The "
			dfn data-dfn-for="details" id="attr-details-name" data-dfn-type="element-attr" {
				code {
					- "name"
				}
			}
			- " content\n  attribute gives the name of the group of related "
			code id="the-details-element:the-details-element-6" {
				a href="#the-details-element" {
					- "details"
				}
			}
			- " elements that the element is\n  a member of. Opening one member of this group causes other members of the group to close. If the\n  attribute is specified, its value must not be the empty string."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "Before using this feature, authors should consider whether this grouping of related\n  "
			code id="the-details-element:the-details-element-7" {
				a href="#the-details-element" {
					- "details"
				}
			}
			- " elements into an exclusive accordion is helpful or harmful to users.\n  While using an exclusive accordion can reduce the maximum amount of space that a set of content\n  can occupy, it can also frustrate users who have to open many items to find what they want or\n  users who want to look at the contents of multiple items at the same time."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "A document must not contain more than one "
			code id="the-details-element:the-details-element-8" {
				a href="#the-details-element" {
					- "details"
				}
			}
			- " element in the same\n  "
			a href="#details-name-group" id="the-details-element:details-name-group" {
				- "details name group"
			}
			- " that has the "
			code id="the-details-element:attr-details-open-2" {
				a href="#attr-details-open" {
					- "open"
				}
			}
			- "\n  attribute present.  Authors must not use script to add "
			code id="the-details-element:the-details-element-9" {
				a href="#the-details-element" {
					- "details"
				}
			}
			- " elements to a document\n  in a way that would cause a "
			a href="#details-name-group" id="the-details-element:details-name-group-2" {
				- "details name group"
			}
			- " to have more than one\n  "
			code id="the-details-element:the-details-element-10" {
				a href="#the-details-element" {
					- "details"
				}
			}
			- " element with the "
			code id="the-details-element:attr-details-open-3" {
				a href="#attr-details-open" {
					- "open"
				}
			}
			- " attribute\n  present."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p class="note" {
			- "The group of elements that is created by a common "
			code id="the-details-element:attr-details-name-2" {
				a href="#attr-details-name" {
					- "name"
				}
			}
			- " attribute is exclusive, meaning that at most one of the\n  "
			code id="the-details-element:the-details-element-11" {
				a href="#the-details-element" {
					- "details"
				}
			}
			- " elements can be open at once.  While this exclusivity is enforced by user\n  agents, the resulting enforcement immediately changes the "
			code id="the-details-element:attr-details-open-4" {
				a href="#attr-details-open" {
					- "open"
