		- "\n\n  "
		p class="note" {
			- "Visually and programmatically grouping related elements together can be important\n  for accessible user experiences. This can help users understand the relationship between such\n  elements. When related elements are in disparate sections of a web page rather than being grouped,\n  the elements' relationships to each other can be less discoverable or understandable."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "The "
			dfn data-dfn-for="details" id="attr-details-open" data-dfn-type="element-attr" {
				code {
					- "open"
				}
			}
