					a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Element/summary" title="The <summary> HTML element specifies a summary, caption, or legend for a <details> element's disclosure box. Clicking the <summary> element toggles the state of the parent <details> element open and closed." {
						- "Element/summary"
