		- "\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n  "
		h4 id="commands" {
			span class="secno" {
				- "4.11.3"
			}
			- " Commands"
			a href="#commands" class="self-link"
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		h5 id="facets-2" {
			span class="secno" {
				- "4.11.3.1"
			}
			- " Facets"
			a href="#facets-2" class="self-link"
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "A "
			dfn id="concept-command" {
				- "command"
			}
			- " is the abstraction behind menu items, buttons, and\n  links. Once a command is defined, other parts of the interface can refer to the same command,\n  allowing many access points to a single feature to share facets such as the "
			a href="#command-facet-disabledstate" id="facets-2:command-facet-disabledstate" {
				- "Disabled State"
			}
			- "."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p id="facets" {
			- "Commands are defined to have the following "
			dfn id="concept-facet" {
				- "facets"
			}
			- ":"
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		dl {
			dt {
				dfn id="command-facet-label" {
					- "Label"
				}
			}
			dd {
				- "The name of the command as seen by the user."
			}
			dt {
				dfn id="command-facet-accesskey" {
					- "Access Key"
				}
			}
			dd {
				- "A key combination selected by the user agent that triggers the command. A command might not\n   have an Access Key."
			}
			dt {
				dfn id="command-facet-hiddenstate" {
					- "Hidden State"
				}
			}
			dd {
				- "Whether the command is hidden or not (basically, whether it should be shown in menus)."
			}
			dt {
				dfn id="command-facet-disabledstate" {
					- "Disabled State"
				}
			}
			dd {
				- "Whether the command is relevant and can be triggered or not."
			}
			dt {
				dfn id="command-facet-action" {
					- "Action"
				}
			}
			dd {
				- "The actual effect that triggering the command will have. This could be a scripted event\n   handler, a "
				a id="facets-2:url" href="https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-url" data-x-internal="url" {
					- "URL"
				}
				- " to which to "
				a href="#navigate" id="facets-2:navigate" {
					- "navigate"
				}
				- ", or a form submission."
			}
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p id="expose-commands-in-ui" {
			- "User agents may expose the "
			a href="#concept-command" id="facets-2:concept-command" {
				- "commands"
			}
			- " that match the following criteria:"
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		ul {
			li {
				p {
					- "The "
					a href="#command-facet-hiddenstate" id="facets-2:command-facet-hiddenstate" {
						- "Hidden State"
					}
					- " facet is false\n   (visible)"
				}
			}
			li {
				p {
					- "The element is "
					a id="facets-2:in-a-document" href="https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#in-a-document" data-x-internal="in-a-document" {
						- "in a document"
					}
					- " with a non-null "
					a href="#concept-document-bc" id="facets-2:concept-document-bc" {
						- "browsing context"
					}
					- "."
				}
			}
			li {
				p {
					- "Neither the element nor any of its ancestors has a "
					code id="facets-2:attr-hidden" {
						a href="#attr-hidden" {
							- "hidden"
						}
					}
					- " attribute specified."
				}
			}
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "User agents are encouraged to do this especially for commands that have "
			a href="#command-facet-accesskey" id="facets-2:command-facet-accesskey" {
				- "Access Keys"
			}
			- ", as a way to advertise those keys to the\n  user."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p class="example" {
			- "For example, such commands could be listed in the user agent's menu bar."
		}
		- "\n\n\n  \n\n  "
		h5 id="using-the-a-element-to-define-a-command" {
			span class="secno" {
				- "4.11.3.2"
			}
			- " "
			dfn {
				- "Using the "
				code {
					- "a"
				}
				- " element to define a command"
			}
			a href="#using-the-a-element-to-define-a-command" class="self-link"
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "An "
			code id="using-the-a-element-to-define-a-command:the-a-element" {
				a href="#the-a-element" {
					- "a"
				}
			}
			- " element with an "
			code id="using-the-a-element-to-define-a-command:attr-hyperlink-href" {
				a href="#attr-hyperlink-href" {
					- "href"
				}
			}
			- " attribute "
			a href="#concept-command" id="using-the-a-element-to-define-a-command:concept-command" {
				- "defines a command"
			}
			- "."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "The "
			a href="#command-facet-label" id="using-the-a-element-to-define-a-command:command-facet-label" {
				- "Label"
			}
			- " of the command is the element's\n  "
			a id="using-the-a-element-to-define-a-command:descendant-text-content" href="https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-descendant-text-content" data-x-internal="descendant-text-content" {
				- "descendant text content"
			}
			- "."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "The "
			a href="#command-facet-accesskey" id="using-the-a-element-to-define-a-command:command-facet-accesskey" {
				- "Access Key"
			}
			- " of the command is the element's\n  "
			a href="#assigned-access-key" id="using-the-a-element-to-define-a-command:assigned-access-key" {
				- "assigned access key"
			}
			- ", if any."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "The "
			a href="#command-facet-hiddenstate" id="using-the-a-element-to-define-a-command:command-facet-hiddenstate" {
				- "Hidden State"
			}
			- " of the command is true (hidden)\n  if the element has a "
			code id="using-the-a-element-to-define-a-command:attr-hidden" {
				a href="#attr-hidden" {
					- "hidden"
				}
			}
			- " attribute, and false otherwise."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "The "
			a href="#command-facet-disabledstate" id="using-the-a-element-to-define-a-command:command-facet-disabledstate" {
				- "Disabled State"
			}
			- " facet of the command is\n  true if the element or one of its ancestors is "
			a href="#inert" id="using-the-a-element-to-define-a-command:inert" {
				- "inert"
			}
			- ", and false otherwise."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "The "
			a href="#command-facet-action" id="using-the-a-element-to-define-a-command:command-facet-action" {
				- "Action"
			}
			- " of the command is to "
			a href="#fire-a-click-event" id="using-the-a-element-to-define-a-command:fire-a-click-event" {
				- "fire a "
				code {
					- "click"
				}
				- " event"
			}
			- " at the element."
		}
		- "\n\n\n  "
		h5 id="using-the-button-element-to-define-a-command" {
			span class="secno" {
				- "4.11.3.3"
			}
			- " "
			dfn {
				- "Using the "
				code {
					- "button"
				}
				- " element to define a command"
			}
			a href="#using-the-button-element-to-define-a-command" class="self-link"
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "A "
			code id="using-the-button-element-to-define-a-command:the-button-element" {
				a href="#the-button-element" {
					- "button"
				}
			}
			- " element always "
			a href="#concept-command" id="using-the-button-element-to-define-a-command:concept-command" {
				- "defines a\n  command"
			}
			- "."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "The "
			a href="#command-facet-label" id="using-the-button-element-to-define-a-command:command-facet-label" {
				- "Label"
			}
			- ", "
			a href="#command-facet-accesskey" id="using-the-button-element-to-define-a-command:command-facet-accesskey" {
				- "Access Key"
			}
			- ", "
			a href="#command-facet-hiddenstate" id="using-the-button-element-to-define-a-command:command-facet-hiddenstate" {
				- "Hidden State"
			}
			- ", and "
			a href="#command-facet-action" id="using-the-button-element-to-define-a-command:command-facet-action" {
				- "Action"
			}
			- " facets of the command are determined "
			a href="#using-the-a-element-to-define-a-command" id="using-the-button-element-to-define-a-command:using-the-a-element-to-define-a-command" {
				- "as for "
				code {
					- "a"
				}
				- " elements"
			}
			- " (see the previous section)."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "The "
			a href="#command-facet-disabledstate" id="using-the-button-element-to-define-a-command:command-facet-disabledstate" {
				- "Disabled State"
			}
			- " of the command is true if\n  the element or one of its ancestors is "
			a href="#inert" id="using-the-button-element-to-define-a-command:inert" {
				- "inert"
			}
			- ", or if the element's "
			a href="#concept-fe-disabled" id="using-the-button-element-to-define-a-command:concept-fe-disabled" {
				- "disabled"
			}
			- " state is set, and false otherwise."
		}
		- "\n\n\n  "
		h5 id="using-the-input-element-to-define-a-command" {
			span class="secno" {
				- "4.11.3.4"
			}
			- " "
			dfn {
				- "Using the "
				code {
					- "input"
				}
				- " element to define a command"
			}
			a href="#using-the-input-element-to-define-a-command" class="self-link"
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "An "
			code id="using-the-input-element-to-define-a-command:the-input-element" {
				a href="#the-input-element" {
					- "input"
				}
			}
			- " element whose "
			code id="using-the-input-element-to-define-a-command:attr-input-type" {
				a href="#attr-input-type" {
					- "type"
				}
			}
			- " attribute is in\n  one of the "
			a href="#submit-button-state-(type=submit)" id="using-the-input-element-to-define-a-command:submit-button-state-(type=submit)" {
				- "Submit Button"
			}
