		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "Scripts allow authors to add interactivity to their documents."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "Authors are encouraged to use declarative alternatives to scripting where possible, as\n  declarative mechanisms are often more maintainable, and many users disable scripting."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
