			- "\n\n   "
			p {
				- "When script is disabled, a button appears to do the calculation on the server side. When\n   script is enabled, the value is computed on-the-fly instead."
			}
			- "\n\n   "
			p {
				- "The "
				code id="the-noscript-element:the-noscript-element-30" {
					a href="#the-noscript-element" {
						- "noscript"
					}
				}
				- " element is a blunt instrument. Sometimes, scripts might be enabled,\n   but for some reason the page's script might fail. For this reason, it's generally better to avoid\n   using "
				code id="the-noscript-element:the-noscript-element-31" {
					a href="#the-noscript-element" {
						- "noscript"
					}
				}
				- ", and to instead design the script to change the page from being a\n   scriptless page to a scripted page on the fly, as in the next example:"
			}
