				- "\n\n    "
				p {
					img src="/images/drawImage.png" width="356" alt="The sx and sy parameters give\n    the x and y coordinates of the source rectangle; the sw and sh arguments give the width and\n    height of the source rectangle; the dx and dy give the x and y coordinates of the destination\n    rectangle; and the dw and dh arguments give the width and height of the destination\n    rectangle." height="356"
				}
				- "\n\n    "
				p {
					- "If the image isn't yet fully decoded, then nothing is drawn. If the image is a canvas with no\n    data, throws an "
					a id="drawing-images:invalidstateerror" href="https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#invalidstateerror" data-x-internal="invalidstateerror" {
						- "\""
