		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "Finally, we can also use the "
			a href="#custom-element-constructor" id="custom-elements-autonomous-example:custom-element-constructor" {
				- "custom element constructor"
			}
			- " itself. That is, the above\n  code is equivalent to:"
