		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "Each "
			a href="#form-associated-custom-element" id="form-associated-custom-elements:form-associated-custom-element" {
				- "form-associated custom element"
			}
			- " has "
			dfn id="face-submission-value" {
				- "submission value"
			}
			- ". It is used to provide one or more\n  "
			a href="#form-entry" id="form-associated-custom-elements:form-entry" {
				- "entries"
			}
			- " on form submission.\n  The initial value of "
			a href="#face-submission-value" id="form-associated-custom-elements:face-submission-value-3" {
				- "submission value"
			}
			- " is null, and\n  "
			a href="#face-submission-value" id="form-associated-custom-elements:face-submission-value-4" {
				- "submission value"
			}
			- " can be null, a string, a\n  "
			code id="form-associated-custom-elements:file" {
				a data-x-internal="file" href="https://w3c.github.io/FileAPI/#dfn-file" {
					- "File"
				}
			}
			- ", or a "
			a id="form-associated-custom-elements:list" href="https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#list" data-x-internal="list" {
				- "list"
			}
			- " of "
			a href="#form-entry" id="form-associated-custom-elements:form-entry-2" {
				- "entries"
			}
			- "."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "Each "
			a href="#form-associated-custom-element" id="form-associated-custom-elements:form-associated-custom-element-2" {
				- "form-associated custom element"
			}
			- " has "
			dfn id="face-state" {
				- "state"
			}
			- ".\n  It is information with which the user agent can restore a user's input for the element.\n  The initial value of "
			a href="#face-state" id="form-associated-custom-elements:face-state-3" {
				- "state"
			}
			- " is null, and "
			a href="#face-state" id="form-associated-custom-elements:face-state-4" {
				- "state"
			}
			- " can be null, a string, a "
			code id="form-associated-custom-elements:file-2" {
				a data-x-internal="file" href="https://w3c.github.io/FileAPI/#dfn-file" {
					- "File"
				}
			}
			- ", or a\n  "
			a id="form-associated-custom-elements:list-2" href="https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#list" data-x-internal="list" {
				- "list"
			}
			- " of "
			a href="#form-entry" id="form-associated-custom-elements:form-entry-3" {
				- "entries"
			}
			- "."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "The "
			code id="form-associated-custom-elements:dom-elementinternals-setformvalue-3" {
				a href="#dom-elementinternals-setformvalue" {
					- "setFormValue()"
				}
			}
			- " method is used by\n  the custom element author to set the element's "
			a href="#face-submission-value" id="form-associated-custom-elements:face-submission-value-5" {
				- "submission\n  value"
			}
			- " and "
			a href="#face-state" id="form-associated-custom-elements:face-state-5" {
				- "state"
			}
			- ", thus communicating these to the user\n  agent."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "When the user agent believes it is a good idea to restore a "
			a href="#form-associated-custom-element" id="form-associated-custom-elements:form-associated-custom-element-3" {
				- "form-associated custom\n  element"
			}
			- "'s "
			a href="#face-state" id="form-associated-custom-elements:face-state-6" {
				- "state"
			}
			- ", for example "
			a href="#restore-persisted-state" id="form-associated-custom-elements:restore-persisted-state" {
				- "after navigation"
			}
			- " or restarting the user agent, they may "
			a href="#enqueue-a-custom-element-callback-reaction" id="form-associated-custom-elements:enqueue-a-custom-element-callback-reaction" {
				- "enqueue a\n  custom element callback reaction"
			}
			- " with that element, callback name \""
			code {
				- "formStateRestoreCallback"
			}
			- "\", and « the state to be restored, \""
			code {
				- "restore"
			}
			- "\" »."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "If the user agent has a form-filling assist feature, then when the feature is invoked, it may\n  "
			a href="#enqueue-a-custom-element-callback-reaction" id="form-associated-custom-elements:enqueue-a-custom-element-callback-reaction-2" {
				- "enqueue a custom element callback reaction"
			}
			- " with a "
			a href="#form-associated-custom-element" id="form-associated-custom-elements:form-associated-custom-element-4" {
				- "form-associated custom\n  element"
			}
			- ", callback name \""
			code {
				- "formStateRestoreCallback"
			}
			- "\", and « the state\n  value determined by history of state value and some heuristics, \""
			code {
				- "autocomplete"
			}
			- "\" »."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "In general, the "
			a href="#face-state" id="form-associated-custom-elements:face-state-7" {
				- "state"
			}
			- " is information specified by a user, and\n  the "
			a href="#face-submission-value" id="form-associated-custom-elements:face-submission-value-6" {
				- "submission value"
			}
			- " is a value after canonicalization\n  or sanitization, suitable for submission to the server. The following examples makes this\n  concrete:"
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p class="example" {
			- "Suppose that we have a "
			a href="#form-associated-custom-element" id="form-associated-custom-elements:form-associated-custom-element-5" {
				- "form-associated custom element"
			}
			- " which asks a\n  user to specify a date. The user specifies "
			kbd {
				- "\"3/15/2019\""
			}
			- ", but the control wishes to\n  submit "
			code {
				- "\"2019-03-15\""
			}
			- " to the server. "
			kbd {
				- "\"3/15/2019\""
			}
			- " would be a "
			a href="#face-state" id="form-associated-custom-elements:face-state-8" {
				- "state"
			}
			- " of the element, and "
			code {
				- "\"2019-03-15\""
