		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "Similarly, for date- and time-related data, the "
			code id="the-basic-syntax:the-time-element" {
				a href="#the-time-element" {
					- "time"
				}
			}
			- " element and its "
			code id="the-basic-syntax:attr-time-datetime" {
				a href="#attr-time-datetime" {
					- "datetime"
				}
			}
			- " attribute can be used instead."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		div class="example" {
			- "\n\n   "
			p {
				- "In this example, the item has one property, \"birthday\", whose value is a date:"
			}
			- "\n\n   "
