		p {
			- "Elements with an "
			code id="items:attr-itemscope-5" {
				a href="#attr-itemscope" {
					- "itemscope"
				}
			}
			- " attribute and an "
			code id="items:attr-itemtype-4" {
				a href="#attr-itemtype" {
					- "itemtype"
				}
			}
			- " attribute that references a vocabulary that is defined to\n  "
			dfn id="support-global-identifiers-for-items" {
				- "support global identifiers for items"
			}
			- " may also have an "
			dfn data-dfn-for="html-global" id="attr-itemid" data-dfn-type="element-attr" {
				code {
					- "itemid"
				}
			}
			- " attribute specified, to give a\n  global identifier for the "
			a href="#concept-item" id="items:concept-item-8" {
				- "item"
			}
			- ", so that it can be related to\n  other "
			a href="#concept-item" id="items:concept-item-9" {
				- "items"
			}
			- " on pages elsewhere on the web."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "The "
			code id="items:attr-itemid" {
				a href="#attr-itemid" {
					- "itemid"
				}
			}
			- " attribute, if specified, must have a value that is\n  a "
			a href="#valid-url-potentially-surrounded-by-spaces" id="items:valid-url-potentially-surrounded-by-spaces" {
				- "valid URL potentially surrounded by spaces"
			}
			- "."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "The "
			dfn id="global-identifier" {
				- "global identifier"
			}
			- " of an "
			a href="#concept-item" id="items:concept-item-10" {
				- "item"
			}
			- " is the value of\n  its element's "
			code id="items:attr-itemid-2" {
				a href="#attr-itemid" {
					- "itemid"
				}
			}
			- " attribute, if it has one, "
			a href="#encoding-parsing-a-url" id="items:encoding-parsing-a-url" {
				- "parsed"
			}
			- " relative to the "
			a id="items:node-document" href="https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-node-document" data-x-internal="node-document" {
				- "node document"
			}
			- " of the\n  element on which the attribute is specified. If the "
			code id="items:attr-itemid-3" {
				a href="#attr-itemid" {
					- "itemid"
				}
			}
			- "\n  attribute is missing or if parsing it returns failure, it is said to have no "
			a href="#global-identifier" id="items:global-identifier" {
				- "global\n  identifier"
			}
			- "."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "The "
			code id="items:attr-itemid-4" {
				a href="#attr-itemid" {
					- "itemid"
				}
			}
			- " attribute must not be specified on elements that do\n  not have both an "
			code id="items:attr-itemscope-6" {
				a href="#attr-itemscope" {
					- "itemscope"
				}
			}
			- " attribute and an "
			code id="items:attr-itemtype-5" {
				a href="#attr-itemtype" {
					- "itemtype"
				}
			}
			- " attribute specified, and must not be specified on elements\n  with an "
			code id="items:attr-itemscope-7" {
				a href="#attr-itemscope" {
					- "itemscope"
				}
			}
			- " attribute whose "
			code id="items:attr-itemtype-6" {
				a href="#attr-itemtype" {
					- "itemtype"
				}
			}
			- " attribute specifies a vocabulary that does not "
			a href="#support-global-identifiers-for-items" id="items:support-global-identifiers-for-items" {
				- "support\n  global identifiers for items"
			}
			- ", as defined by that vocabulary's specification."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "The exact meaning of a "
			a href="#global-identifier" id="items:global-identifier-2" {
				- "global identifier"
			}
			- " is determined by the vocabulary's\n  specification. It is up to such specifications to define whether multiple items with the same\n  global identifier (whether on the same page or on different pages) are allowed to exist, and what\n  the processing rules for that vocabulary are with respect to handling the case of multiple items\n  with the same ID."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		hr
		- "\n\n  "
		div class="mdn-anno wrapped before" {
