		- "\n\n   \n\n\n  "
		h4 id="microdata-and-other-namespaces" {
			span class="secno" {
				- "5.2.6"
			}
			- " Microdata and other namespaces"
			a href="#microdata-and-other-namespaces" class="self-link"
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "Currently, the "
			code id="microdata-and-other-namespaces:attr-itemscope" {
				a href="#attr-itemscope" {
					- "itemscope"
				}
			}
			- ", "
			code id="microdata-and-other-namespaces:names:-the-itemprop-attribute" {
				a href="#names:-the-itemprop-attribute" {
					- "itemprop"
				}
			}
			- ", and other microdata attributes are only defined for\n  "
			a href="#html-elements" id="microdata-and-other-namespaces:html-elements" {
				- "HTML elements"
			}
			- ". This means that attributes with the literal names \""
			code {
				- "itemscope"
			}
			- "\", \""
			code {
				- "itemprop"
			}
			- "\", etc, do not cause microdata\n  processing to occur on elements in other namespaces, such as SVG."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		div class="example" {
			- "\n\n   "
			p {
				- "Thus, in the following example there is only one item, not\n   two."
			}
			- "\n\n   "
			pre class="bad" {
				code class="html" {
					c- p="" {
						- "<"
					}
					c- f="" {
						- "p"
					}
					- " "
					c- e="" {
						- "itemscope"
					}
					c- p="" {
						- "></"
					}
					c- f="" {
						- "p"
					}
					c- p="" {
						- ">"
					}
					- " "
					c- c="" {
						- "<!-- this is an item (with no properties and no type) -->"
					}
					- "\n"
					c- p="" {
						- "<"
					}
					c- f="" {
						- "svg"
					}
					- " "
					c- e="" {
						- "itemscope"
					}
					c- p="" {
						- "></"
					}
					c- f="" {
						- "svg"
					}
					c- p="" {
						- ">"
					}
					- " "
					c- c="" {
						- "<!-- this is not, it's just an "
					}
					a id="microdata-and-other-namespaces:svg-svg" href="https://svgwg.org/svg2-draft/struct.html#SVGElement" data-x-internal="svg-svg" {
						c- c="" {
							- "SVG "
						}
						code {
							c- c="" {
								- "svg"
							}
						}
					}
					c- c="" {
						- " element with an invalid unknown attribute -->"
					}
				}
			}
			- "\n\n  "
		}
		- "\n\n\n  "
		h3 id="mdvocabs" {
			span class="secno" {
				- "5.3"
			}
			- " Sample microdata vocabularies"
			a href="#mdvocabs" class="self-link"
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "The vocabularies in this section are primarily intended to demonstrate how a vocabulary is\n  specified, though they are also usable in their own right."
		}
		- "\n\n\n  "
		h4 id="vcard" {
			span class="secno" {
				- "5.3.1"
			}
			- " vCard"
			a href="#vcard" class="self-link"
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "An item with the "
			a href="#item-types" id="vcard:item-types" {
				- "item type"
			}
			- " "
			dfn id="md-vcard" {
				code {
					- "http://microformats.org/profile/hcard"
				}
			}
			- " represents a person's or\n  organization's contact information."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "This vocabulary does not "
			a href="#support-global-identifiers-for-items" id="vcard:support-global-identifiers-for-items" {
				- "support global identifiers for items"
			}
			- "."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "The following are the type's "
			a href="#defined-property-name" id="vcard:defined-property-name" {
				- "defined property\n  names"
			}
			- ". They are based on the vocabulary defined in "
			cite {
				- "vCard Format Specification"
			}
			- "\n  ("
			cite {
				- "vCard"
			}
			- ") and its extensions, where more information on how to interpret the values can\n  be found. "
			a href="#refsRFC6350" {
				- "[RFC6350]"
			}
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		dl {
			dt {
				dfn id="md-vcard-kind" {
					code {
						- "kind"
					}
				}
			}
			dd {
				- "\n    "
				p {
					- "Describes what kind of contact the item represents."
				}
				- "\n\n    "
				p {
					- "The "
					a href="#concept-property-value" id="vcard:concept-property-value" {
						- "value"
					}
					- " must be text that is "
					a id="vcard:identical-to" href="https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#string-is" data-x-internal="identical-to" {
						- "identical\n    to"
					}
					- " one of the "
					a href="#kind-strings" id="vcard:kind-strings" {
						- "kind strings"
					}
					- "."
				}
				- "\n\n    "
				p {
					- "A single property with the name "
					code id="vcard:md-vcard-kind" {
						a href="#md-vcard-kind" {
							- "kind"
						}
					}
					- " may be present within\n    each "
					a href="#concept-item" id="vcard:concept-item" {
						- "item"
					}
					- " with the type "
					code id="vcard:md-vcard" {
						a href="#md-vcard" {
							- "http://microformats.org/profile/hcard"
						}
					}
					- "."
				}
				- "\n   "
			}
			dt {
				dfn id="md-vcard-fn" {
					code {
						- "fn"
					}
				}
			}
			dd {
				- "\n    "
				p {
					- "Gives the formatted text corresponding to the name of the person or organization."
				}
				- "\n\n    "
				p {
					- "The "
					a href="#concept-property-value" id="vcard:concept-property-value-2" {
						- "value"
					}
					- " must be text."
				}
				- "\n\n    "
				p {
					- "Exactly one property with the name "
					code id="vcard:md-vcard-fn" {
						a href="#md-vcard-fn" {
							- "fn"
						}
					}
					- " must be present within\n    each "
					a href="#concept-item" id="vcard:concept-item-2" {
						- "item"
					}
					- " with the type "
					code id="vcard:md-vcard-2" {
