		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p class="note" {
			- "Historically, the "
			code id="focus-management-apis:dom-window-focus" {
				a href="#dom-window-focus" {
					- "focus()"
				}
			}
			- " and "
			code id="focus-management-apis:dom-window-blur" {
				a href="#dom-window-blur" {
					- "blur()"
				}
			}
			- " methods actually affected the system-level focus of the\n  system widget (e.g., tab or window) that contained the "
			a href="#navigable" id="focus-management-apis:navigable" {
				- "navigable"
			}
			- ", but hostile sites\n  widely abuse this behavior to the user's detriment."
