				}
			}
			- "\n  content attribute set. The "
			code id="the-accesskey-attribute:the-accesskey-attribute-2" {
				a href="#the-accesskey-attribute" {
					- "accesskey"
				}
			}
			- " attribute's value is used\n  by the user agent as a guide for creating a keyboard shortcut that activates or focuses the\n  element."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "If specified, the value must be an "
			a href="#ordered-set-of-unique-space-separated-tokens" id="the-accesskey-attribute:ordered-set-of-unique-space-separated-tokens" {
				- "ordered set of unique space-separated tokens"
			}
			- "\n  none of which are "
			a id="the-accesskey-attribute:identical-to" href="https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#string-is" data-x-internal="identical-to" {
				- "identical to"
			}
			- " another token and each of which must be exactly one\n  code point in length."
		}
