				code {
					- "draggable"
				}
			}
			- " IDL\n  attribute, whose value depends on the content attribute's in the way described below, controls\n  whether or not the element is draggable. Generally, only text selections are draggable, but\n  elements whose "
			code id="the-draggable-attribute:dom-draggable" {
