		- "\n\n\n  "
		h5 id="relaxing-the-same-origin-restriction" {
			span class="secno" {
				- "7.1.1.2"
			}
			- " Relaxing the same-origin restriction"
			a href="#relaxing-the-same-origin-restriction" class="self-link"
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		dl class="domintro" {
			dt {
				code {
					var {
						- "document"
					}
					- "."
					a href="#dom-document-domain" id="dom-document-domain-dev" {
						- "domain"
					}
					- " [ = "
					var {
						- "domain"
					}
					- " ]"
				}
			}
			dd {
				- "\n    "
				p {
					- "Returns the current domain used for security checks."
				}
				- "\n\n    "
				p {
					- "Can be set to a value that removes subdomains, to change the "
					a href="#concept-origin" id="relaxing-the-same-origin-restriction:concept-origin" {
						- "origin"
					}
					- "'s "
					a href="#concept-origin-domain" id="relaxing-the-same-origin-restriction:concept-origin-domain" {
						- "domain"
					}
					- " to allow pages on other subdomains of the same\n    domain (if they do the same thing) to access each other. This enables pages on different hosts\n    of a domain to synchronously access each other's DOMs."
				}
				- "\n\n    "
				p {
					- "In sandboxed "
					code id="relaxing-the-same-origin-restriction:the-iframe-element" {
						a href="#the-iframe-element" {
							- "iframe"
						}
					}
					- "s, "
					code id="relaxing-the-same-origin-restriction:document" {
						a href="#document" {
							- "Document"
						}
					}
					- "s with "
					a href="#concept-origin-opaque" id="relaxing-the-same-origin-restriction:concept-origin-opaque" {
						- "opaque origins"
					}
					- ", and "
					code id="relaxing-the-same-origin-restriction:document-2" {
						a href="#document" {
							- "Document"
						}
					}
					- "s without a "
					a href="#concept-document-bc" id="relaxing-the-same-origin-restriction:concept-document-bc" {
						- "browsing context"
					}
					- ", the setter will\n    throw a "
					a id="relaxing-the-same-origin-restriction:securityerror" href="https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#securityerror" data-x-internal="securityerror" {
						- "\""
						code {
							- "SecurityError"
						}
						- "\""
					}
					- " exception. In cases where "
					code id="relaxing-the-same-origin-restriction:dom-crossoriginisolated" {
						a href="#dom-crossoriginisolated" {
							- "crossOriginIsolated"
						}
					}
					- " or "
					code id="relaxing-the-same-origin-restriction:dom-originagentcluster" {
						a href="#dom-originagentcluster" {
							- "originAgentCluster"
						}
					}
					- " return true, the setter will do\n    nothing."
				}
				- "\n   "
			}
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		div class="critical" {
			- "\n   "
			p {
				- "Avoid using the "
				code id="relaxing-the-same-origin-restriction:dom-document-domain" {
					a href="#dom-document-domain" {
						- "document.domain"
					}
				}
				- " setter. It\n   undermines the security protections provided by the same-origin policy. This is especially acute\n   when using shared hosting; for example, if an untrusted third party is able to host an HTTP\n   server at the same IP address but on a different port, then the same-origin protection that\n   normally protects two different sites on the same host will fail, as the ports are ignored when\n   comparing origins after the "
				code id="relaxing-the-same-origin-restriction:dom-document-domain-2" {
					a href="#dom-document-domain" {
						- "document.domain"
					}
				}
				- " setter has\n   been used."
			}
			- "\n\n   "
			p {
				- "Because of these security pitfalls, this feature is in the process of being removed from the\n   web platform. (This is a long process that takes many years.)"
			}
			- "\n\n   "
			p {
				- "Instead, use "
				code id="relaxing-the-same-origin-restriction:dom-window-postmessage" {
					a href="#dom-window-postmessage" {
						- "postMessage()"
					}
				}
				- " or\n   "
				code id="relaxing-the-same-origin-restriction:messagechannel" {
					a href="#messagechannel" {
						- "MessageChannel"
					}
				}
				- " objects to communicate across origins in a safe manner."
			}
			- "\n  "
		}
		- "\n\n  \n\n  "
		p {
			- "The "
			dfn data-dfn-for="Document" id="dom-document-domain" data-dfn-type="attribute" {
				code {
					- "domain"
				}
			}
			- "\n  getter steps are:"
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		ol {
			li {
				p {
					- "Let "
					var {
						- "effectiveDomain"
					}
					- " be "
					a id="relaxing-the-same-origin-restriction:this" href="https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this" data-x-internal="this" {
						- "this"
					}
					- "'s "
					a href="https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-document-origin" id="relaxing-the-same-origin-restriction:concept-document-origin" data-x-internal="concept-document-origin" {
						- "origin"
					}
					- "'s "
					a href="#concept-origin-effective-domain" id="relaxing-the-same-origin-restriction:concept-origin-effective-domain" {
						- "effective domain"
					}
					- ".\n\n   "
				}
			}
			li {
				p {
					- "If "
					var {
						- "effectiveDomain"
					}
					- " is null, then return the empty string."
				}
			}
			li {
				p {
					- "Return "
					var {
						- "effectiveDomain"
					}
					- ", "
					a href="https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-host-serializer" id="relaxing-the-same-origin-restriction:host-serializer" data-x-internal="host-serializer" {
						- "serialized"
					}
					- "."
				}
			}
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "The "
			code id="relaxing-the-same-origin-restriction:dom-document-domain-3" {
				a href="#dom-document-domain" {
					- "domain"
				}
			}
			- " setter steps are:"
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		ol {
			li {
				p {
					- "If "
					a id="relaxing-the-same-origin-restriction:this-2" href="https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#this" data-x-internal="this" {
						- "this"
					}
					- "'s "
					a href="#concept-document-bc" id="relaxing-the-same-origin-restriction:concept-document-bc-2" {
						- "browsing context"
					}
					- " is\n   null, then throw a "
					a id="relaxing-the-same-origin-restriction:securityerror-2" href="https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#securityerror" data-x-internal="securityerror" {
						- "\""
						code {
							- "SecurityError"
						}
						- "\""
					}
					- " "
					code id="relaxing-the-same-origin-restriction:domexception" {
						a data-x-internal="domexception" href="https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#dfn-DOMException" {
							- "DOMException"
						}
					}
					- "."
				}
