		}
		- "\n\n  \n\n  "
		p class="warning" {
			- "The "
			code id="the-location-interface:location-3" {
				a href="#location" {
					- "Location"
				}
			}
			- " exotic object is defined through a mishmash of IDL,\n  invocation of JavaScript internal methods post-creation, and overridden JavaScript internal\n  methods. Coupled with its scary security policy, please take extra care while implementing\n  this excrescence."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "To create a "
