		- "\n\n  "
		div class="example" {
			- "\n\n   "
			p {
				- "Consider a game where the user can navigate along a line, such that the user is always at some\n   coordinate, and such that the user can bookmark the page corresponding to a particular\n   coordinate, to return to it later."
			}
			- "\n\n   "
			p {
				- "A static page implementing the x=5 position in such a game could look like the following:"
			}
			- "\n\n   "
			pre {
				code class="html" {
					c- cp="" {
						- "<!DOCTYPE HTML>"
					}
					- "\n"
					c- c="" {
						- "<!-- this is https://example.com/line?x=5 -->"
					}
					- "\n"
					c- p="" {
						- "<"
					}
					c- f="" {
						- "html"
					}
					- " "
					c- e="" {
						- "lang"
					}
					c- o="" {
