		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "The navigation API, provided by the global "
			code id="navigation-api-intro:dom-navigation" {
				a href="#dom-navigation" {
					- "navigation"
				}
			}
			- "\n  property, provides a modern and web application-focused way of managing navigations and history entries. It is a successor to the classic "
			code id="navigation-api-intro:dom-location" {
