		- "\n\n\n  "
		h4 id="navigating-across-documents" {
			span class="secno" {
				- "7.4.2"
			}
			- " "
			span id="browsing-the-web"
			- "Navigation"
			a href="#navigating-across-documents" class="self-link"
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "Certain actions cause a "
			a href="#navigable" id="navigating-across-documents:navigable" {
				- "navigable"
			}
			- " to "
			i id="navigating-across-documents:navigate" {
				a href="#navigate" {
					- "navigate"
				}
			}
			- " to\n  a new resource."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p class="example" {
			- "For example, "
			a href="#following-hyperlinks-2" id="navigating-across-documents:following-hyperlinks-2" {
				- "following a hyperlink"
			}
			- ",\n  "
			a href="#concept-form-submit" id="navigating-across-documents:concept-form-submit" {
				- "form submission"
			}
			- ", and the "
			code id="navigating-across-documents:dom-open" {
				a href="#dom-open" {
					- "window.open()"
				}
			}
			- " and "
			code id="navigating-across-documents:dom-location-assign" {
				a href="#dom-location-assign" {
					- "location.assign()"
				}
			}
			- " methods can all cause navigation."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		div id="note-meaning-of-navigate" class="note" {
			- "\n   "
			p {
				- "Although in this standard the word \"navigation\" refers specifically to the\n   "
				a href="#navigate" id="navigating-across-documents:navigate-2" {
					- "navigate"
				}
				- " algorithm, this doesn't always line up with web developer or user\n   perceptions. For example:"
			}
			- "\n\n   "
			ul {
				li {
					p {
						- "The "
						a href="#url-and-history-update-steps" id="navigating-across-documents:url-and-history-update-steps" {
							- "URL and history update steps"
						}
						- " are often used during so-called\n    \"single-page app navigations\" or \"same-document navigations\", but they do not trigger the\n    "
						a href="#navigate" id="navigating-across-documents:navigate-3" {
							- "navigate"
						}
						- " algorithm."
					}
				}
				li {
					p {
						a href="#reload" id="navigating-across-documents:reload" {
							- "Reloads"
						}
						- " and "
						a href="#traverse-the-history-by-a-delta" id="navigating-across-documents:traverse-the-history-by-a-delta" {
							- "traversals"
						}
						- " are sometimes talked about as a type of navigation, since all three\n    will often "
						a href="#attempt-to-populate-the-history-entry's-document" id="navigating-across-documents:attempt-to-populate-the-history-entry's-document" {
							- "attempt to populate the history entry's document"
						}
						- " and thus could perform\n    navigational fetches. See, e.g., the APIs exposed "
						cite {
							- "Navigation Timing"
						}
						- ". But they have\n    their own entry point algorithms, separate from the "
						a href="#navigate" id="navigating-across-documents:navigate-4" {
							- "navigate"
						}
						- " algorithm.\n    "
						a href="#refsNAVIGATIONTIMING" {
							- "[NAVIGATIONTIMING]"
						}
					}
				}
				li {
					p {
						- "Although "
						a href="#navigate-fragid" id="navigating-across-documents:navigate-fragid" {
							- "fragment navigations"
						}
						- " are always done\n    through the "
						a href="#navigate" id="navigating-across-documents:navigate-5" {
							- "navigate"
						}
						- " algorithm, a user might perceive them as more like jumping\n    around a single page, than as a true navigation."
					}
				}
			}
			- "\n  "
		}
		- "\n\n\n  "
		h5 id="navigation-supporting-concepts" {
			span class="secno" {
				- "7.4.2.1"
			}
			- " Supporting concepts"
			a href="#navigation-supporting-concepts" class="self-link"
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "Before we can jump into the "
			a href="#navigate" id="navigation-supporting-concepts:navigate" {
				- "navigation algorithm"
			}
			- " itself, we\n  need to establish several important structures that it uses."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "The "
			dfn id="source-snapshot-params" {
				- "source snapshot params"
			}
			- " "
			a id="navigation-supporting-concepts:struct" href="https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#struct" data-x-internal="struct" {
				- "struct"
			}
			- " is used to capture data from a\n  "
			code id="navigation-supporting-concepts:document" {
				a href="#document" {
					- "Document"
				}
			}
			- " initiating a navigation. It is snapshotted at the beginning of a navigation\n  and used throughout the navigation's lifetime. It has the following "
			a href="https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#struct-item" id="navigation-supporting-concepts:struct-item" data-x-internal="struct-item" {
				- "items"
			}
			- ":"
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		dl {
			dt {
				dfn id="source-snapshot-params-activation" {
					- "has transient activation"
				}
			}
			dd {
				- "a boolean"
			}
			dt {
				dfn id="source-snapshot-params-sandbox" {
					- "sandboxing flags"
				}
			}
			dd {
				- "a "
				a href="#sandboxing-flag-set" id="navigation-supporting-concepts:sandboxing-flag-set" {
					- "sandboxing flag set"
				}
			}
			dt {
				dfn id="source-snapshot-params-download" {
					- "allows downloading"
				}
			}
			dd {
				- "a boolean"
			}
			dt {
				dfn id="source-snapshot-params-client" {
					- "fetch client"
				}
			}
			dd {
				- "an "
				a href="#environment-settings-object" id="navigation-supporting-concepts:environment-settings-object" {
					- "environment settings object"
				}
				- ", only to be used as a "
				a href="https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-request-client" id="navigation-supporting-concepts:concept-request-client" data-x-internal="concept-request-client" {
					- "request client"
				}
			}
			dt {
				dfn id="source-snapshot-params-policy-container" {
					- "source policy container"
				}
			}
			dd {
				- "a "
				a href="#policy-container" id="navigation-supporting-concepts:policy-container" {
					- "policy container"
				}
			}
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "To "
			dfn id="snapshotting-source-snapshot-params" {
				- "snapshot source snapshot params"
			}
			- "\n  given a "
			code id="navigation-supporting-concepts:document-2" {
				a href="#document" {
					- "Document"
				}
			}
			- " "
			var {
				- "sourceDocument"
			}
			- ", return a new "
			a href="#source-snapshot-params" id="navigation-supporting-concepts:source-snapshot-params" {
				- "source snapshot\n  params"
			}
			- " with"
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		dl class="props" {
			dt {
				a href="#source-snapshot-params-activation" id="navigation-supporting-concepts:source-snapshot-params-activation" {
					- "has transient activation"
				}
			}
			dd {
				- "true if "
				var {
					- "sourceDocument"
				}
				- "'s "
				a href="#concept-relevant-global" id="navigation-supporting-concepts:concept-relevant-global" {
					- "relevant global object"
				}
				- " has "
				a href="#transient-activation" id="navigation-supporting-concepts:transient-activation" {
					- "transient\n   activation"
				}
				- "; otherwise false"
			}
			dt {
				a href="#source-snapshot-params-sandbox" id="navigation-supporting-concepts:source-snapshot-params-sandbox" {
					- "sandboxing flags"
				}
			}
			dd {
				var {
					- "sourceDocument"
				}
				- "'s "
				a href="#active-sandboxing-flag-set" id="navigation-supporting-concepts:active-sandboxing-flag-set" {
					- "active sandboxing flag set"
				}
			}
			dt {
				a href="#source-snapshot-params-download" id="navigation-supporting-concepts:source-snapshot-params-download" {
					- "allows downloading"
				}
			}
			dd {
				- "false if "
				var {
					- "sourceDocument"
				}
				- "'s "
				a href="#active-sandboxing-flag-set" id="navigation-supporting-concepts:active-sandboxing-flag-set-2" {
					- "active sandboxing flag set"
				}
				- " has the\n   "
				a href="#sandboxed-downloads-browsing-context-flag" id="navigation-supporting-concepts:sandboxed-downloads-browsing-context-flag" {
					- "sandboxed downloads browsing context flag"
				}
				- " set; otherwise true"
			}
			dt {
				a href="#source-snapshot-params-client" id="navigation-supporting-concepts:source-snapshot-params-client" {
					- "fetch client"
				}
			}
			dd {
				var {
					- "sourceDocument"
				}
				- "'s "
				a href="#relevant-settings-object" id="navigation-supporting-concepts:relevant-settings-object" {
					- "relevant settings object"
				}
			}
			dt {
				a href="#source-snapshot-params-policy-container" id="navigation-supporting-concepts:source-snapshot-params-policy-container" {
					- "source policy container"
				}
			}
			dd {
				var {
					- "sourceDocument"
				}
				- "'s "
				a href="#concept-document-policy-container" id="navigation-supporting-concepts:concept-document-policy-container" {
					- "policy\n   container"
				}
			}
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		hr
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "The "
			dfn id="target-snapshot-params" {
				- "target snapshot params"
			}
			- " "
			a id="navigation-supporting-concepts:struct-2" href="https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#struct" data-x-internal="struct" {
				- "struct"
			}
			- " is used to capture data from a\n  "
			a href="#navigable" id="navigation-supporting-concepts:navigable" {
				- "navigable"
			}
			- " being navigated. Like "
			a href="#source-snapshot-params" id="navigation-supporting-concepts:source-snapshot-params-2" {
				- "source snapshot params"
			}
			- ", it is\n  snapshotted at the beginning of a navigation and used throughout the navigation's lifetime. It\n  has the following "
			a href="https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#struct-item" id="navigation-supporting-concepts:struct-item-2" data-x-internal="struct-item" {
				- "items"
			}
			- ":"
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		dl {
			dt {
				dfn id="target-snapshot-params-sandbox" {
					- "sandboxing flags"
				}
			}
			dd {
				- "a "
				a href="#sandboxing-flag-set" id="navigation-supporting-concepts:sandboxing-flag-set-2" {
					- "sandboxing flag set"
				}
			}
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "To "
			dfn id="snapshotting-target-snapshot-params" {
				- "snapshot target snapshot params"
			}
			- "\n  given a "
			a href="#navigable" id="navigation-supporting-concepts:navigable-2" {
				- "navigable"
			}
			- " "
			var {
				- "targetNavigable"
			}
			- ", return a new "
			a href="#target-snapshot-params" id="navigation-supporting-concepts:target-snapshot-params" {
				- "target snapshot\n  params"
			}
			- " with "
			a href="#target-snapshot-params-sandbox" id="navigation-supporting-concepts:target-snapshot-params-sandbox" {
				- "sandboxing flags"
			}
			- " set to\n  the result of "
			a href="#determining-the-creation-sandboxing-flags" id="navigation-supporting-concepts:determining-the-creation-sandboxing-flags" {
				- "determining the creation sandboxing flags"
			}
			- " given\n  "
			var {
				- "targetNavigable"
			}
			- "'s "
			a href="#nav-bc" id="navigation-supporting-concepts:nav-bc" {
				- "active browsing context"
			}
			- " and\n  "
			var {
				- "targetNavigable"
			}
			- "'s "
			a href="#nav-container" id="navigation-supporting-concepts:nav-container" {
				- "container"
			}
			- "."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		hr
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "Much of the navigation process is concerned with determining how to create a new\n  "
			code id="navigation-supporting-concepts:document-3" {
				a href="#document" {
					- "Document"
				}
			}
			- ", which ultimately happens in the "
			a href="#initialise-the-document-object" id="navigation-supporting-concepts:initialise-the-document-object" {
				- "create and initialize a "
				code {
					- "Document"
				}
				- " object"
			}
			- "\n  algorithm. The parameters to that algorithm are tracked via a "
			dfn id="navigation-params" {
				- "navigation params"
			}
			- "\n  "
			a id="navigation-supporting-concepts:struct-3" href="https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#struct" data-x-internal="struct" {
				- "struct"
			}
			- ", which has the following "
			a href="https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#struct-item" id="navigation-supporting-concepts:struct-item-3" data-x-internal="struct-item" {
				- "items"
			}
			- ":"
		}
		- "\n\n  \n  "
		dl {
			dt {
				dfn id="navigation-params-id" {
					- "id"
				}
			}
			dd {
				- "null or a "
				a href="#navigation-id" id="navigation-supporting-concepts:navigation-id" {
					- "navigation ID"
				}
			}
			dt {
				dfn id="navigation-params-navigable" {
					- "navigable"
				}
			}
			dd {
				- "the "
				a href="#navigable" id="navigation-supporting-concepts:navigable-3" {
					- "navigable"
				}
				- " to be navigated"
			}
			dt {
				dfn id="navigation-params-request" {
					- "request"
				}
			}
			dd {
				- "null or a "
				a href="https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-request" id="navigation-supporting-concepts:concept-request" data-x-internal="concept-request" {
					- "request"
				}
				- " that started the navigation"
			}
			dt {
				dfn id="navigation-params-response" {
					- "response"
				}
			}
			dd {
				- "a "
				a href="https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-response" id="navigation-supporting-concepts:concept-response" data-x-internal="concept-response" {
					- "response"
				}
				- " that ultimately was navigated to\n   (potentially a "
				a id="navigation-supporting-concepts:network-error" href="https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-network-error" data-x-internal="network-error" {
					- "network error"
				}
				- ")"
			}
			dt {
				dfn id="navigation-params-fetch-controller" {
					- "fetch controller"
				}
			}
			dd {
				- "null or a "
				a id="navigation-supporting-concepts:fetch-controller" href="https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#fetch-controller" data-x-internal="fetch-controller" {
					- "fetch controller"
				}
			}
			dt {
				dfn id="navigation-params-commit-early-hints" {
					- "commit early hints"
				}
			}
			dd {
				- "null or an algorithm accepting a "
				code id="navigation-supporting-concepts:document-4" {
					a href="#document" {
						- "Document"
					}
				}
				- ", once it has been created"
			}
			dt {
				dfn id="navigation-params-coop-enforcement-result" {
					- "COOP enforcement result"
				}
			}
			dd {
				- "an "
				a href="#coop-enforcement-result" id="navigation-supporting-concepts:coop-enforcement-result" {
					- "opener policy enforcement result"
				}
				- ", used for\n   reporting and potentially for causing a "
				a href="#browsing-context-group-switches-due-to-cross-origin-opener-policy" {
					- "browsing context\n   group switch"
				}
			}
			dt {
				dfn id="navigation-params-reserved-environment" {
					- "reserved environment"
				}
			}
			dd {
				- "null or an "
				a href="#environment" id="navigation-supporting-concepts:environment" {
					- "environment"
				}
				- " reserved for the new "
				code id="navigation-supporting-concepts:document-5" {
					a href="#document" {
						- "Document"
					}
				}
			}
			dt {
				dfn id="navigation-params-origin" {
					- "origin"
				}
			}
			dd {
				- "an "
				a href="#concept-origin" id="navigation-supporting-concepts:concept-origin" {
					- "origin"
				}
				- " to use for the new "
				code id="navigation-supporting-concepts:document-6" {
					a href="#document" {
						- "Document"
					}
				}
			}
			dt {
				dfn id="navigation-params-policy-container" {
					- "policy container"
				}
			}
			dd {
				- "a "
				a href="#policy-container" id="navigation-supporting-concepts:policy-container-2" {
					- "policy container"
				}
				- " to use for the new "
				code id="navigation-supporting-concepts:document-7" {
					a href="#document" {
						- "Document"
					}
				}
			}
			dt {
				dfn id="navigation-params-sandboxing" {
					- "final sandboxing flag set"
				}
			}
			dd {
				- "a "
				a href="#sandboxing-flag-set" id="navigation-supporting-concepts:sandboxing-flag-set-3" {
					- "sandboxing flag set"
				}
				- " to impose on the new "
				code id="navigation-supporting-concepts:document-8" {
					a href="#document" {
						- "Document"
					}
				}
			}
			dt {
				dfn id="navigation-params-coop" {
					- "opener policy"
				}
			}
			dd {
				- "an "
				a href="#cross-origin-opener-policy" id="navigation-supporting-concepts:cross-origin-opener-policy" {
					- "opener policy"
				}
				- " to use for the new "
				code id="navigation-supporting-concepts:document-9" {
					a href="#document" {
						- "Document"
					}
				}
			}
			dt {
				dfn id="navigation-params-nav-timing-type" {
					- "navigation timing type"
				}
			}
			dd {
				- "a "
				code id="navigation-supporting-concepts:navigationtimingtype" {
					a data-x-internal="navigationtimingtype" href="https://w3c.github.io/navigation-timing/#dom-navigationtimingtype" {
						- "NavigationTimingType"
					}
				}
				- " used for "
				a href="https://w3c.github.io/navigation-timing/#dfn-create-the-navigation-timing-entry" id="navigation-supporting-concepts:create-the-navigation-timing-entry" data-x-internal="create-the-navigation-timing-entry" {
					- "creating the navigation timing entry"
				}
				- " for the new "
				code id="navigation-supporting-concepts:document-10" {
					a href="#document" {
						- "Document"
					}
				}
			}
			dt {
				dfn id="navigation-params-about-base-url" {
					- "about base URL"
				}
			}
			dd {
				- "a "
				a id="navigation-supporting-concepts:url" href="https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-url" data-x-internal="url" {
					- "URL"
				}
				- " or null used to populate the new "
				code id="navigation-supporting-concepts:document-11" {
					a href="#document" {
						- "Document"
					}
				}
				- "'s "
				a href="#concept-document-about-base-url" id="navigation-supporting-concepts:concept-document-about-base-url" {
					- "about base URL"
				}
			}
			dt {
				dfn id="navigation-params-user-involvement" {
					- "user involvement"
				}
			}
			dd {
				- "a "
				a href="#user-navigation-involvement" id="navigation-supporting-concepts:user-navigation-involvement" {
					- "user navigation involvement"
				}
				- " used when "
				a href="#obtain-browsing-context-navigation" id="navigation-supporting-concepts:obtain-browsing-context-navigation" {
					- "obtaining a browsing context"
				}
				- " for the new\n   "
				code id="navigation-supporting-concepts:document-12" {
					a href="#document" {
						- "Document"
					}
				}
			}
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p class="note" {
			- "Once a "
			a href="#navigation-params" id="navigation-supporting-concepts:navigation-params" {
				- "navigation params"
			}
			- " struct is created, this standard does not\n  mutate any of its "
			a href="https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#struct-item" id="navigation-supporting-concepts:struct-item-4" data-x-internal="struct-item" {
				- "items"
			}
			- ". They are only passed onward to other\n  algorithms."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		hr
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "A "
			dfn id="navigation-id" {
				- "navigation ID"
			}
			- " is a UUID string generated during navigation. It is used to\n  interface with the "
			cite {
				- "WebDriver BiDi"
			}
			- " specification as well as to track the "
			a href="#ongoing-navigation" id="navigation-supporting-concepts:ongoing-navigation" {
				- "ongoing\n  navigation"
			}
			- ". "
			a href="#refsWEBDRIVERBIDI" {
				- "[WEBDRIVERBIDI]"
			}
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		hr
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "After "
			code id="navigation-supporting-concepts:document-13" {
				a href="#document" {
					- "Document"
				}
			}
			- " creation, the relevant "
			a href="#traversable-navigable" id="navigation-supporting-concepts:traversable-navigable" {
				- "traversable navigable"
			}
			- "'s "
			a href="#tn-session-history-entries" id="navigation-supporting-concepts:tn-session-history-entries" {
				- "session history"
			}
			- " gets updated. The\n  "
			code id="navigation-supporting-concepts:navigationhistorybehavior" {
				a href="#navigationhistorybehavior" {
					- "NavigationHistoryBehavior"
				}
			}
			- " enumeration is used to indicate the desired type of session\n  history update to the "
			a href="#navigate" id="navigation-supporting-concepts:navigate-2" {
				- "navigate"
			}
			- " algorithm. It is one of the following:"
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		dl {
			dt id="hh-default" {
				span id="hh-push"
				- "\""
				dfn data-dfn-for="NavigationHistoryBehavior" id="navigationhistorybehavior-push" data-dfn-type="enum-value" {
					code {
						- "push"
					}
				}
				- "\""
			}
			dd {
				- "A regular navigation which adds a new "
				a href="#session-history-entry" id="navigation-supporting-concepts:session-history-entry" {
					- "session history entry"
				}
				- ", and will\n   "
				a href="#clear-the-forward-session-history" id="navigation-supporting-concepts:clear-the-forward-session-history" {
					- "clear the forward session history"
				}
				- "."
			}
			dt id="hh-replace" {
				- "\""
				dfn data-dfn-for="NavigationHistoryBehavior" id="navigationhistorybehavior-replace" data-dfn-type="enum-value" {
					code {
						- "replace"
					}
				}
				- "\""
			}
			dd {
				- "A navigation that will replace the "
				a href="#nav-active-history-entry" id="navigation-supporting-concepts:nav-active-history-entry" {
					- "active session\n   history entry"
				}
				- "."
			}
			dt {
				- "\""
				dfn data-dfn-for="NavigationHistoryBehavior" id="navigationhistorybehavior-auto" data-dfn-type="enum-value" {
					code {
						- "auto"
					}
				}
				- "\""
			}
			dd {
				- "The default value, which will be converted very early in the "
				a href="#navigate" id="navigation-supporting-concepts:navigate-3" {
					- "navigate"
				}
				- " algorithm\n   into \""
				code id="navigation-supporting-concepts:navigationhistorybehavior-push" {
					a href="#navigationhistorybehavior-push" {
						- "push"
					}
				}
				- "\" or \""
				code id="navigation-supporting-concepts:navigationhistorybehavior-replace" {
					a href="#navigationhistorybehavior-replace" {
						- "replace"
					}
				}
				- "\". Usually it becomes \""
				code id="navigation-supporting-concepts:navigationhistorybehavior-push-2" {
					a href="#navigationhistorybehavior-push" {
						- "push"
					}
				}
				- "\", but under "
				a href="#navigate-convert-to-replace" {
					- "certain circumstances"
				}
				- " it becomes \""
				code id="navigation-supporting-concepts:navigationhistorybehavior-replace-2" {
					a href="#navigationhistorybehavior-replace" {
						- "replace"
					}
				}
				- "\" instead."
			}
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "A "
			dfn id="history-handling-behavior" {
				- "history handling behavior"
			}
			- " is a "
			code id="navigation-supporting-concepts:navigationhistorybehavior-2" {
				a href="#navigationhistorybehavior" {
					- "NavigationHistoryBehavior"
				}
			}
			- " that is\n  either \""
			code id="navigation-supporting-concepts:navigationhistorybehavior-push-3" {
				a href="#navigationhistorybehavior-push" {
					- "push"
				}
			}
			- "\" or \""
			code id="navigation-supporting-concepts:navigationhistorybehavior-replace-3" {
				a href="#navigationhistorybehavior-replace" {
					- "replace"
				}
			}
			- "\", i.e., that has been resolved away from\n  any initial \""
			code id="navigation-supporting-concepts:navigationhistorybehavior-auto" {
				a href="#navigationhistorybehavior-auto" {
					- "auto"
				}
			}
			- "\" value."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			dfn id="the-navigation-must-be-a-replace" {
				- "The navigation must be a replace"
			}
			- ", given a "
			a id="navigation-supporting-concepts:url-2" href="https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-url" data-x-internal="url" {
				- "URL"
			}
			- " "
			var {
				- "url"
			}
			- " and a\n  "
			code id="navigation-supporting-concepts:document-14" {
				a href="#document" {
					- "Document"
				}
			}
			- " "
			var {
				- "document"
			}
			- ", if any of the following are true:"
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		ul {
			li {
				p {
					var {
						- "url"
					}
					- "'s "
					a href="https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-url-scheme" id="navigation-supporting-concepts:concept-url-scheme" data-x-internal="concept-url-scheme" {
						- "scheme"
					}
					- " is \""
					code id="navigation-supporting-concepts:the-javascript:-url-special-case" {
						a href="#the-javascript:-url-special-case" {
							- "javascript"
						}
					}
					- "\"; or"
				}
			}
			li {
				p {
					var {
						- "document"
					}
					- "'s "
					a href="#is-initial-about:blank" id="navigation-supporting-concepts:is-initial-about:blank" {
						- "is initial "
						code {
							- "about:blank"
						}
					}
					- " is true."
				}
			}
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		div class="note" {
			- "\n   "
			p {
				- "Other cases that often, but not always, force a \""
				code id="navigation-supporting-concepts:navigationhistorybehavior-replace-4" {
					a href="#navigationhistorybehavior-replace" {
						- "replace"
					}
				}
				- "\" navigation are:"
			}
			- "\n\n   "
			ul {
				li {
					p {
						- "if the "
						code id="navigation-supporting-concepts:document-15" {
							a href="#document" {
								- "Document"
							}
						}
						- " is not "
						a href="#completely-loaded" id="navigation-supporting-concepts:completely-loaded" {
							- "completely loaded"
						}
						- "; or"
					}
				}
				li {
					p {
						- "if the target "
						a id="navigation-supporting-concepts:url-3" href="https://url.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-url" data-x-internal="url" {
							- "URL"
						}
						- " equals the "
						code id="navigation-supporting-concepts:document-16" {
