					}
					- ", "
					a href="#url-state-(type=url)" id="persisted-user-state-restoration:url-state-(type=url)" {
						- "URL"
					}
					- ", or "
					a href="#email-state-(type=email)" id="persisted-user-state-restoration:email-state-(type=email)" {
						- "Email"
					}
					- "\n    state, if the persisted state includes the directionality of user input in such controls."
