				- "XML parser"
			}
			- "."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "The actual HTTP headers and other metadata, not the headers as mutated or implied by the\n  algorithms given in this specification, are the ones that must be used when determining the\n  character encoding according to the rules given in the above specifications. Once the character\n  encoding is established, the "
