			}
			- " is not able to sustain this rate, it might drop to a\n  more sustainable 30 rendering opportunities per second for that "
			a href="#navigable" id="event-loop-processing-model:navigable-6" {
				- "navigable"
			}
			- ", rather\n  than occasionally dropping frames. Similarly, if a "
			a href="#navigable" id="event-loop-processing-model:navigable-7" {
				- "navigable"
			}
			- " is not visible, the\n  user agent might decide to drop that page to a much slower 4 rendering opportunities per second,\n  or even less."
