		- "\n\n  \n\n\n  "
		h3 id="atob" {
			span class="secno" {
				- "8.3"
			}
			- " Base64 utility methods"
			a href="#atob" class="self-link"
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "The "
			code id="atob:dom-atob" {
				a href="#dom-atob" {
					- "atob()"
				}
			}
			- " and "
			code id="atob:dom-btoa" {
				a href="#dom-btoa" {
					- "btoa()"
				}
			}
			- " methods\n  allow developers to transform content to and from the base64 encoding."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p class="note" {
			- "In these APIs, for mnemonic purposes, the \"b\" can be considered to stand for\n  \"binary\", and the \"a\" for \"ASCII\". In practice, though, for primarily historical reasons, both the\n  input and output of these functions are Unicode strings."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		dl class="domintro" {
			dt {
				code {
