		- "\n\n  "
		p class="note" {
			- "For example, a user agent might want to only display the first 100 characters of a\n  message. Or, a user agent might replace the middle of the string with \"…\". These types of\n  modifications can be useful in limiting the abuse potential of unnaturally large,\n  trustworthy-looking system dialogs."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "We "
			dfn id="cannot-show-simple-dialogs" {
				- "cannot show simple dialogs"
			}
			- " for a "
			code id="simple-dialogs:window" {
