		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "In certain cases, despite the best efforts of the entire industry, web browsers have bugs and\n  limitations that web authors are forced to work around."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "This section defines a collection of attributes that can be used to determine, from script, the\n  kind of user agent in use, in order to work around these issues."
		}
		- "\n\n  \n\n  "
		p {
			- "The user agent has a "
			dfn id="concept-navigator-compatibility-mode" {
				- "navigator compatibility\n  mode"
			}
			- ", which is either "
			i {
				- "Chrome"
			}
			- ", "
			i {
				- "Gecko"
			}
			- ", or "
			i {
				- "WebKit"
			}
			- "."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p class="note" {
			- "The "
			a href="#concept-navigator-compatibility-mode" id="client-identification:concept-navigator-compatibility-mode" {
				- "navigator compatibility\n  mode"
			}
			- " constrains the "
			code id="client-identification:navigatorid" {
