					a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/requestAnimationFrame" title="The window.requestAnimationFrame() method tells the browser that you wish to perform an animation and requests that the browser calls a specified function to update an animation right before the next repaint. The method takes a callback as an argument to be invoked before the repaint." {
