		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			i {
				- "This section is non-normative."
			}
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "In this example, multiple windows (viewers) can be opened that are all viewing the same map.\n  All the windows share the same map information, with a single worker coordinating all the viewers.\n  Each viewer can move around independently, but if they set any data on the map, all the viewers\n  are updated."
		}
