		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "It consists of a loop to start the subworkers, and then a handler\n  that waits for all the subworkers to respond."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "The subworkers are implemented as follows:"
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		pre {
			code class="js" {
				c- a="" {
