			- "Creating a worker requires a URL to a JavaScript file. The "
			code id="creating-a-dedicated-worker:dom-worker" {
				a href="#dom-worker" {
					- "Worker()"
				}
			}
			- " constructor is invoked with the URL to that file as its only\n  argument; a worker is then created and returned:"
