							a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/sessionStorage" title="The read-only sessionStorage property accesses a session Storage object for the current origin. sessionStorage is similar to localStorage; the difference is that while data in localStorage doesn't expire, data in sessionStorage is cleared when the page session ends." {
