		- "\n\n\n  "
		h5 id="the-stack-of-open-elements" {
			span class="secno" {
				- "13.2.4.2"
			}
			- " The stack of open elements"
			a href="#the-stack-of-open-elements" class="self-link"
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "Initially, the "
			dfn id="stack-of-open-elements" {
				- "stack of open elements"
			}
			- " is empty. The stack grows downwards; the\n  topmost node on the stack is the first one added to the stack, and the bottommost node of the\n  stack is the most recently added node in the stack (notwithstanding when the stack is manipulated\n  in a random access fashion as part of "
			a href="#adoptionAgency" {
				- "the handling for misnested\n  tags"
			}
			- ")."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p class="note" {
			- "The \""
			a href="#the-before-html-insertion-mode" id="the-stack-of-open-elements:the-before-html-insertion-mode" {
				- "before html"
			}
			- "\"\n  "
			a href="#insertion-mode" id="the-stack-of-open-elements:insertion-mode" {
				- "insertion mode"
			}
			- " creates the "
			code id="the-stack-of-open-elements:the-html-element" {
				a href="#the-html-element" {
					- "html"
				}
			}
			- " "
			a id="the-stack-of-open-elements:document-element" href="https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#document-element" data-x-internal="document-element" {
				- "document element"
			}
			- ", which is\n  then added to the stack."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p class="note" {
			- "In the "
			a href="#fragment-case" id="the-stack-of-open-elements:fragment-case" {
				- "fragment case"
			}
			- ", the "
			a href="#stack-of-open-elements" id="the-stack-of-open-elements:stack-of-open-elements" {
				- "stack of open elements"
			}
			- " is\n  initialized to contain an "
			code id="the-stack-of-open-elements:the-html-element-2" {
				a href="#the-html-element" {
					- "html"
				}
			}
			- " element that is created as part of "
			a href="#html-fragment-parsing-algorithm" id="the-stack-of-open-elements:html-fragment-parsing-algorithm" {
				- "that algorithm"
			}
			- ". (The "
			a href="#fragment-case" id="the-stack-of-open-elements:fragment-case-2" {
				- "fragment case"
			}
			- " skips the\n  \""
			a href="#the-before-html-insertion-mode" id="the-stack-of-open-elements:the-before-html-insertion-mode-2" {
				- "before html"
			}
			- "\" "
			a href="#insertion-mode" id="the-stack-of-open-elements:insertion-mode-2" {
				- "insertion mode"
			}
			- ".)"
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "The "
			code id="the-stack-of-open-elements:the-html-element-3" {
				a href="#the-html-element" {
					- "html"
				}
			}
			- " node, however it is created, is the topmost node of the stack. It only\n  gets popped off the stack when the parser "
			a href="#stop-parsing" id="the-stack-of-open-elements:stop-parsing" {
				- "finishes"
			}
			- "."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "The "
			dfn id="current-node" {
				- "current node"
