					}
				}
				- " by 16.\n    Add a numeric version of the "
				a href="#current-input-character" id="hexadecimal-character-reference-state:current-input-character" {
					- "current input character"
				}
				- " (subtract 0x0030 from the\n    character's code point) to the "
