			- " off the\n  "
			a href="#stack-of-open-elements" id="closing-elements-that-have-implied-end-tags:stack-of-open-elements-2" {
				- "stack of open elements"
			}
			- "."
		}
		- "\n\n\n\n  "
		h5 id="parsing-main-inhtml" {
			span class="secno" {
				- "13.2.6.4"
			}
			- " The rules for parsing tokens in HTML content"
			a href="#parsing-main-inhtml" class="self-link"
		}
		- "\n\n\n  "
		h6 id="the-initial-insertion-mode" {
			span class="secno" {
				- "13.2.6.4.1"
			}
			- " The \""
			dfn {
				- "initial"
			}
			- "\" insertion mode"
			a href="#the-initial-insertion-mode" class="self-link"
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "A "
			code id="the-initial-insertion-mode:document" {
				a href="#document" {
					- "Document"
				}
			}
			- " object has an associated "
			dfn id="parser-cannot-change-the-mode-flag" {
				- "parser cannot change the mode flag"
			}
			- "\n  (a boolean). It is initially false."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "When the user agent is to apply the rules for the \""
			a href="#the-initial-insertion-mode" id="the-initial-insertion-mode:the-initial-insertion-mode" {
				- "initial"
			}
			- "\" "
			a href="#insertion-mode" id="the-initial-insertion-mode:insertion-mode" {
				- "insertion mode"
			}
			- ", the user agent must handle the token as\n  follows:"
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		dl class="switch" {
			dt {
				- "A character token that is one of U+0009 CHARACTER\n   TABULATION, U+000A LINE FEED (LF), U+000C FORM FEED (FF),\n   U+000D CARRIAGE RETURN (CR), or U+0020 SPACE"
			}
			dd {
				- "\n    "
				p {
					- "Ignore the token."
				}
				- "\n   "
			}
			dt {
				- "A comment token"
			}
			dd {
				- "\n    "
				p {
					a href="#insert-a-comment" id="the-initial-insertion-mode:insert-a-comment" {
						- "Insert a comment"
					}
					- " as the last child of the "
					code id="the-initial-insertion-mode:document-2" {
						a href="#document" {
							- "Document"
						}
					}
					- " object."
				}
				- "\n   "
			}
			dt {
				- "A DOCTYPE token"
			}
			dd {
				- "\n    "
				p {
					- "If the DOCTYPE token's name is not \""
					code {
						- "html"
					}
					- "\", or the token's public\n    identifier is not missing, or the token's system identifier is neither missing nor\n    \""
					code id="the-initial-insertion-mode:about:legacy-compat" {
						a href="#about:legacy-compat" {
							- "about:legacy-compat"
						}
					}
					- "\", then there is a "
					a href="#parse-errors" id="the-initial-insertion-mode:parse-errors" {
						- "parse error"
					}
					- "."
				}
				- "\n\n    "
				p {
					- "Append a "
					code id="the-initial-insertion-mode:documenttype" {
						a data-x-internal="documenttype" href="https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#interface-documenttype" {
							- "DocumentType"
						}
					}
					- " node to the "
					code id="the-initial-insertion-mode:document-3" {
						a href="#document" {
							- "Document"
						}
					}
					- " node, with its "
					a href="https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-doctype-name" id="the-initial-insertion-mode:concept-doctype-name" data-x-internal="concept-doctype-name" {
						- "name"
					}
					- " set to the name given in the DOCTYPE token, or the\n    empty string if the name was missing; its "
					a href="https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-doctype-publicid" id="the-initial-insertion-mode:concept-doctype-publicid" data-x-internal="concept-doctype-publicid" {
						- "public\n    ID"
					}
					- " set to the public identifier given in the DOCTYPE token, or the empty string if the\n    public identifier was missing; and its "
					a href="https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-doctype-systemid" id="the-initial-insertion-mode:concept-doctype-systemid" data-x-internal="concept-doctype-systemid" {
						- "system ID"
					}
					- "\n    set to the system identifier given in the DOCTYPE token, or the empty string if the system\n    identifier was missing."
				}
				- "\n\n    "
				p class="note" {
					- "This also ensures that the "
					code id="the-initial-insertion-mode:documenttype-2" {
						a data-x-internal="documenttype" href="https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#interface-documenttype" {
							- "DocumentType"
						}
					}
					- " node is returned as the\n    value of the "
					code id="the-initial-insertion-mode:dom-document-doctype" {
						a data-x-internal="dom-document-doctype" href="https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-document-doctype" {
							- "doctype"
						}
					}
					- " attribute of the\n    "
					code id="the-initial-insertion-mode:document-4" {
						a href="#document" {
							- "Document"
						}
					}
					- " object."
				}
				- "\n\n    "
				p id="quirks-mode-doctypes" {
					- "Then, if the document is "
					em {
						- "not"
					}
					- " "
					a href="#an-iframe-srcdoc-document" id="the-initial-insertion-mode:an-iframe-srcdoc-document" {
						- "an "
						code {
							- "iframe"
						}
						- "\n    "
						code {
							- "srcdoc"
						}
						- " document"
					}
					- ", and the "
					a href="#parser-cannot-change-the-mode-flag" id="the-initial-insertion-mode:parser-cannot-change-the-mode-flag" {
						- "parser cannot\n    change the mode flag"
					}
					- " is false, and the DOCTYPE token matches one of the conditions in the\n    following list, then set the "
					code id="the-initial-insertion-mode:document-5" {
						a href="#document" {
							- "Document"
						}
					}
					- " to "
					a id="the-initial-insertion-mode:quirks-mode" href="https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-document-quirks" data-x-internal="quirks-mode" {
						- "quirks mode"
					}
					- ":"
				}
				- "\n\n    "
				ul class="brief" {
					li {
						- " The "
						i id="the-initial-insertion-mode:force-quirks-flag" {
							a href="#force-quirks-flag" {
								- "force-quirks flag"
							}
						}
						- " is set to "
						i {
							- "on"
						}
						- ". "
					}
					li {
						- " The name is not \""
						code {
							- "html"
						}
						- "\". "
					}
					li {
						- " The public identifier is set to: \""
						code {
							- "-//W3O//DTD W3 HTML Strict 3.0//EN//"
						}
						- "\" "
					}
					li {
						- " The public identifier is set to: \""
						code {
							- "-/W3C/DTD HTML 4.0 Transitional/EN"
						}
						- "\" "
					}
					li {
						- " The public identifier is set to: \""
						code {
							- "HTML"
						}
						- "\" "
					}
					li {
						- " The system identifier is set to: \""
						code {
							- "http://www.ibm.com/data/dtd/v11/ibmxhtml1-transitional.dtd"
						}
						- "\" "
					}
					li {
						- " The public identifier starts with: \""
						code {
							- "+//Silmaril//dtd html Pro v0r11 19970101//"
						}
						- "\" "
					}
					li {
						- " The public identifier starts with: \""
						code {
							- "-//AS//DTD HTML 3.0 asWedit + extensions//"
						}
						- "\" "
					}
					li {
						- " The public identifier starts with: \""
						code {
							- "-//AdvaSoft Ltd//DTD HTML 3.0 asWedit + extensions//"
						}
						- "\" "
					}
					li {
						- " The public identifier starts with: \""
						code {
							- "-//IETF//DTD HTML 2.0 Level 1//"
						}
						- "\" "
					}
					li {
						- " The public identifier starts with: \""
						code {
							- "-//IETF//DTD HTML 2.0 Level 2//"
						}
						- "\" "
					}
					li {
						- " The public identifier starts with: \""
						code {
							- "-//IETF//DTD HTML 2.0 Strict Level 1//"
						}
						- "\" "
