		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "The interesting part is when the end tag token with the tag name \"b\" is parsed."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "Before that token is seen, the "
			a href="#stack-of-open-elements" id="misnested-tags:-b-p-/b-/p:stack-of-open-elements" {
				- "stack of open elements"
			}
			- " has four elements on it:\n  "
