				- "\n\n    "
				figcaption {
					- "The legend is rendered over the top border, and the top border area reserves\n    vertical space for the legend. The fieldset's top margin starts at the top margin edge of the\n    legend. The legend's horizontal margins, or the "
					a id="the-fieldset-and-legend-elements:'justify-self'-2" href="https://drafts.csswg.org/css-align/#propdef-justify-self" data-x-internal="'justify-self'" {
