			}
			- " box with a "
			a id="the-meter-element-2:'block-size'" href="https://drafts.csswg.org/css-logical/#propdef-block-size" data-x-internal="'block-size'" {
				- "'block-size'"
			}
			- "\n  of '1em' and a "
			a id="the-meter-element-2:'inline-size'" href="https://drafts.csswg.org/css-logical/#propdef-inline-size" data-x-internal="'inline-size'" {
				- "'inline-size'"
			}
			- " of '5em', a "
			a id="the-meter-element-2:'vertical-align'" href="https://drafts.csswg.org/css2/#propdef-vertical-align" data-x-internal="'vertical-align'" {
				- "'vertical-align'"
			}
			- " of '-0.2em', and\n  with its contents depicting a gauge."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "When this element has a "
			a href="#horizontal-writing-mode" id="the-meter-element-2:horizontal-writing-mode" {
				- "horizontal writing mode"
			}
			- ", the depiction is expected to be of\n  a horizontal gauge. Its minimum value is on the right if the "
			a id="the-meter-element-2:'direction'" href="https://drafts.csswg.org/css-writing-modes/#direction" data-x-internal="'direction'" {
				- "'direction'"
			}
			- " property has\n  a "
			a id="the-meter-element-2:computed-value" href="https://drafts.csswg.org/css-cascade/#computed-value" data-x-internal="computed-value" {
				- "computed value"
			}
			- " of 'rtl', and on the left otherwise. When this element has a\n  "
			a href="#vertical-writing-mode" id="the-meter-element-2:vertical-writing-mode" {
				- "vertical writing mode"
			}
			- ", it is expected to depict a vertical gauge. Its minimum value is\n  on the bottom if the "
			a id="the-meter-element-2:'direction'-2" href="https://drafts.csswg.org/css-writing-modes/#direction" data-x-internal="'direction'" {
				- "'direction'"
			}
			- " property has a "
			a id="the-meter-element-2:computed-value-2" href="https://drafts.csswg.org/css-cascade/#computed-value" data-x-internal="computed-value" {
				- "computed value"
			}
			- " of 'rtl',\n  and on the top otherwise."
		}
		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "User agents are expected to use a presentation consistent with platform conventions for gauges,\n  if any."
