		- "\n\n  "
		p {
			- "When the element renders as a "
			a href="#drop-down-box" id="the-select-element-2:drop-down-box-2" {
				- "drop-down box"
			}
			- ", it is a "
			a id="the-select-element-2:devolvable-widget-2" href="https://drafts.csswg.org/css-ui/#devolvable" data-x-internal="devolvable-widget" {
				- "devolvable\n  widget"
			}
			- ". Its appearance in the devolved state, as well as its appearance when the\n  "
			a id="the-select-element-2:computed-value-3" href="https://drafts.csswg.org/css-cascade/#computed-value" data-x-internal="computed-value" {
				- "computed value"
			}
			- " of the element's "
			a id="the-select-element-2:'appearance'" href="https://drafts.csswg.org/css-ui/#appearance-switching" data-x-internal="'appearance'" {
				- "'appearance'"
			}
			- " property is\n  "
			code id="the-select-element-2:'menulist-button'" {
				a data-x-internal="'menulist-button'" href="https://drafts.csswg.org/css-ui/#valdef-appearance-menulist-button" {
					- "'menulist-button'"
				}
			}
			- ", is that of a drop-down box, including a \"drop-down button\",\n  but not necessarily rendered using a native control of the host operating system. In such a state,\n  CSS properties such as "
			a id="the-select-element-2:'color'" href="https://drafts.csswg.org/css-color/#the-color-property" data-x-internal="'color'" {
