			- " element contains a "
			a href="#placeholder-label-option" id="the-select-element-2:placeholder-label-option" {
				- "placeholder label option"
			}
			- ", the user\n  agent is expected to render that "
			code id="the-select-element-2:the-option-element-4" {
				a href="#the-option-element" {
					- "option"
				}
			}
			- " in a manner that conveys that it is a label,\n  rather than a valid option of the control. This can include preventing the "
			a href="#placeholder-label-option" id="the-select-element-2:placeholder-label-option-2" {
				- "placeholder label\n  option"
			}
			- " from being explicitly selected by the user. When the "
